spend.\n\nBusinesses hire Sunsys Technologies for website hosting services for numerous reasons such as high-grade web hosting services, limitless web hosting, budget-friendly price, and optimized WordPress hosting. Besides, it also offers numerous deals and discounts on website hosting.\n\nkey advantages\n\nHigher page speed\nUncompromised security\nDedicated servers in India and the USA\nWeb hosting with cloud features\nFree domain with a premium hosting plan\n\n2. GoDaddy\n\nGoDaddy is another well-known web hosting service provider in India that has earned popularity for offering impeccable yet budget-friendly website hosting services. Its USP is offering the best hosting plan even at the lowest budget.\n\nThe company is popular as a web hosting service provider for numerous reasons like the lowest pricing, higher uptime, and various additional GoDaddy features. The company lets you interact with its dedicated customer support team, which is available 24/7 to take on your queries and resolve them with proper solutions.\n\nKey Advantages\n\nUnlimited bandwidth\nGet some additional services\nWorld-class customer care suppor\nLive chat support\nHigher uptime\nHigher page speed\n\n3. Hostinger\n\nNo matter what type of website you have, Hostinger is the right place to find the best-suited hosting plan. It has varieties of hosting plans based on your website’s needs, so you will not face any difficulty finding the best hosting plan for your website.\n\nThe hosting service provider is popular among those who need hosting services for various reasons, be it cost-effectiveness, dedicated support, or higher speed.\n\nKey Advantages\n\nGet a free domain for every new account\nExpeditious customer support services\nGet access to the Zyro tool without paying any additional amount\nConsistent and higher website speed worldwide\n\n4. Hostgator\n\nAs the oldest website hosting company, it has been catering to website owners with top-notch web hosting services for a long time. So, you have every reason to rely on its services. It’s the best service provider for all those who need cloud-based hosting services.\n\nYou can opt for Hostgator for its website hosting services for various reasons including top-notch customer support, higher speed, reliability, and more. The company is also famous for offering other services such as VPS, reseller, shared, dedicated website hosting, etc.\n\nKey Advantages\n\nAvail of money-back guarantee (up to 45 days)\nNew accounts can get free migration services\nFlexibility in the billing period\nGrab more discount options\nA free domain name, backup, and SSL\nGet 100% uptime\nHigh-grade functionalities\nUnmetered bandwidth and space\n\n5. BlueHost\n\nBlueHost is another web hosting service provider in India that has earned a vast reputation and reliability from users. And it helped the company to secure its positions among the top 10 website hosting service providers in India. BlueHost is another service provider that offers hosting services at extremely affordable prices with lucrative deals and discounts.\n\nApart from this, if you are planning to scale up your business in the coming time, you can easily add several features that you are seeking to do. It helps the company to improve its market reputation and has made it the right choice among service providers.\n\nKey Advantages\n\nGet higher uptime\nFaster loading time\nGet a free domain name\nGet 30 days money-back guarantee\nNo additional/hidden charges\nUnlimited bandwidth and storage\nAffordable hosting services\nDedicated customer support\n\nConclusion\n\nWhile choosing any web hosting company for your business compare the prices, Space, And location of hosting. That helps you website in SEO Prospective.', '{\"v\":1,\"rows\":[{\"cols\":[{\"widgets\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>The performance of your website also depends on the support and security that your hosting service provider renders, apart from its features and functionalities. You need to ensure that the hosting service you choose is good based on the size and type of your website. It’s necessary to opt for a reliable website hosting company for your business website to get world-class services.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Whether you are looking for web hosting companies in India for your newly developed website or seek to change the current hosting provider for your website, you should always opt for a reputed service provider.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Luckily, you will end up with a plethora of options while searching for web hosting companies. We will discuss here some of the Top 5 Best Web Hosting Companies in India that earned a vast market reputation. Take a look.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"<strong>Related Links:</strong>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><strong><a href=\\\"https://www.sunsys.in/website-maintenance-company-in-chennai\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Website Maintenance Company in Chennai</a></strong></p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"List of Top 5 Best Web Hosting Companies in India​\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"1. Sunsys Technologies​\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>One of the top-rated web hosting companies, Sunsys Technologies provides avant-garde hosting services for websites at a budget-friendly cost. Be it individual or shared website hosting, the company caters to your multiple hosting needs. It ensures the complete security of your website, apart from high-end hosting services.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Sunsys specializes in rendering varieties of hosting services like MySQL, PHP, Asp.net, Python, etc. with a dedicated customer support team. With different website hosting plans, it matches the needs of everyone no matter how much they wish to spend.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Businesses hire Sunsys Technologies for website hosting services for numerous reasons such as high-grade web hosting services, limitless web hosting, budget-friendly price, and optimized WordPress hosting. Besides, it also offers numerous deals and discounts on website hosting.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><strong>key advantages</strong></p>\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":true,\"items\":[\"Higher page speed\",\"Uncompromised security\",\"Dedicated servers in India and the USA\",\"Web hosting with cloud features\",\"Free domain with a premium hosting plan\"]},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"2. GoDaddy\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>GoDaddy is another well-known web hosting service provider in India that has earned popularity for offering impeccable yet budget-friendly website hosting services. Its USP is offering the best hosting plan even at the lowest budget.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>The company is popular as a web hosting service provider for numerous reasons like the lowest pricing, higher uptime, and various additional GoDaddy features. The company lets you interact with its dedicated customer support team, which is available 24/7 to take on your queries and resolve them with proper solutions.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><strong>Key Advantages</strong></p>\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":true,\"items\":[\"Unlimited bandwidth\",\"Get some additional services\",\"World-class customer care suppor\",\"Live chat support\",\"Higher uptime\",\"Higher page speed\"]},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"3. Hostinger\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>No matter what type of website you have, Hostinger is the right place to find the best-suited hosting plan. It has varieties of hosting plans based on your website’s needs, so you will not face any difficulty finding the best hosting plan for your website.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>The hosting service provider is popular among those who need hosting services for various reasons, be 