INSERT IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, body, blocks, meta_title, meta_description, cover, category_id, status, published_at, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('website-maintenance-company-in-chennai', 'Website Maintenance Company in Chennai', 'No matter how good your website is, it will not perform as per your expectation unless you keep it up to date from time to time. Here the role of a website maintenance company becomes essential. A we…', 'No matter how good your website is, it will not perform as per your expectation unless you keep it up to date from time to time. Here the role of a website maintenance company becomes essential. A website maintenance company is responsible for making the necessary changes to make your website fully functional and high performing. And thus help your business grow tremendously. Chennai is the best place to find renowned website development companies. So, if you are looking for a website maintenance company in Chennai, you are in the right place to find the best one. Let’s explore some of the top-rated website maintenance company in Chennai. Take a look.\n\nRelated Links:\n\nTop 5 Best Web Hosting Companies in India\n\nTop 5 Website Maintenance Companies in Chennai\n\n1. Sunsys\n\nWhile talking about some of the best website maintenance companies in Chennai, Sunsys comes first. The company provides website maintenance services in Chennai to keep your website alive. It offers world-class website support services, which help you achieve your business goal successfully. No matter what type of website maintenance services you seek to opt for, Sunsys is the right place for you. The company has a group of experts who analyze website links, speed, images, performance, etc. They check your website for bugs and then resolve issues immediately. It understands the expectations of customers and renders a comprehensive solution to match their core issues. It follows a simple process of website maintenance and helps your website function flawlessly. Features of Website Maintenance Services\n\nWebsite & Performance Analysis\nContent and Backend\nUpdates and Improvements\nQuality and Performance Check\nSafety and Security\n24/7 Tech Support\n\n2. JB Soft System\n\nJB Soft System lets your website function smoothly in today’s fast-paced competitive world and ensures its robust performance in Google and other search engines. The company understands its responsibility as a website maintenance service provider and never leaves any stone unturned to deliver the best-in-class website maintenance services. It serves web maintenance as a main service and takes full responsibility to maintain your website with the necessary attention. As one of the reliable website maintenance service providers, JB Soft System understands its prime responsibility and care for your website by managing it with a completely professional touch. Be it regaining the website’s originality, maintaining hosting, support for minor updates, or updating on-page details, the company offers necessary website support services in Chennai to match your expectations.\n\n3. Spidergems\n\nSpidergems is another website maintenance company in Chennai that you can consider hiring. It makes the content of your website relevant and resolves various necessary issues. It updates your website regularly to keep it fresh, up-to-date, and fully functional. If you own an eCommerce website, you can expect the company to add some new products to your website regularly. Spidergems is the right option for those who are looking to hire a website maintenance company in Chennai at affordable prices. Whether you want to pay on an annual, quarterly, or monthly basis, you can pay the company for its maintenance services at your convenience. It offers a fully flexible plan based on the needs of clients.\n\n4. Raga Designers\n\nRaga Designers is another company that offers website maintenance services at affordable costs. The company serves as your best team for website maintenance and does everything to match your expectations. Since its inception, the company has been serving clients with website maintenance services. It provides website maintenance services aiming to reduce your stress. The company ensures that your website performs well and contributes a lot to help your business grow tremendously. Its professionals analyze your website daily for ensuring the better health of your website. Raga Designers specializes in offering a range of services such as CMS Updates, regular testing, content updates, database maintenance, fixing and analyzing website maintenance, and many more.\n\n5. Legend IT Solutions\n\nLegend IT Solutions understands the importance of a website for any business. Website is essential to transform the day-to-day function of your business. It makes your business growing and successful by keeping your website updated. It works with the primary goal of letting your website visitors return, up-to-date, accurate, and also in sync with the latest trends. Whether you want to hire a company for web page updates, website analysis, copywriting, image editing, or online marketing, Legend IT Solutions can be your right destination.\n\nWhy Website Maintenance is Important for Online Business\n\nNow, let’s discuss here some valid reasons that make website maintenance more important for your online business.\n\n1. Improve Brand Reputation\n\nImproving brand reputation is something that is a primary aim of any business. It ensures the growth of your online business. If you have a poorly maintained website, it adversely impacts the growth of your business. You should understand that outdated information, lack of responsiveness, or broken links can hurt your website and visitors. Regular website maintenance ensures a professional and polished online presence of your website. A strong brand reputation is necessary to increase customer loyalty, and a competitive market edge, etc.\n\n2. SEO Monitoring\n\nSearch engine optimization is important to improve the online presence of your website. It helps you increase sales, conversion, and ROI and thus helps your business grow. It helps you analyze your website’s rank, traffic, backlinks, etc. With SEO monitoring, you can find out several potential issues and can take several steps to resolve them. It helps you track progress over time and thus helps you determine the growth of your business.\n\n3. Boosts Traffic\n\nTo provide the best quality of content to searchers, search engines like Google improve the ranking of your websites regularly. A website maintenance service provider increases the ranking of your website. They update your website regularly along with several other activities such as fixing broken links, updating the website with relevant information, updating content, removing duplicate pages, etc.\n\n4. Improve User Experience\n\nAnother reason for hiring a website maintenance service is it helps improve user experience. If you update your website with regular content, it gives you a complete idea about sharable content including image galleries, upcoming events, blogs, etc. These are something that gives an idea to the audience about your website. A well-maintained website is necessary to promote your brand and help you achieve your business objective.\n\nTop 5 Features of Website Maintenance\n\n1. Update Software\n\nWebsites are developed with the use of several software components including plugins, content management systems (CMS), frameworks, themes, etc. So, a software update is one of the most prominent features of a website maintenance service. It includes various updates such as security patches, bug fixing, etc.\n\n2. Testing for Browser Compatibility\n\nIt’s another crucial feature of website maintenance. All you need to do is to make sure that your website functions properly in some common browsers. A website maintenance service provider tests your browser for compatibility.\n\n3. Update Content Regularly\n\nAs mentioned, a regular content update is necessary to keep your website fresh, relevant, and engaging. It includes updating blog posts, images, videos, news articles, and also several other content elements. Fresh content is essential to provide complete value to your website and thus improve your search engine rankings.\n\n4. Performance Optimization\n\nIf your website loads slowly, it leads to a poor user experience and thus minimizes search engine rankings. Website maintenance is a combination of compressing images, optimizing codes, minifying CSS, and JavaScript files, and also implementing various caching mechanisms. These actions help improve the performance of your website.\n\n5. Backup and Disaster Recovery\n\nYou need to back up your website regularly if you have any unforeseen events including hacking attempts, website crashes, accidental data loss, and more. Website maintenance is a process of setting up a completely automated backup system, which can save copies of your files and also database. It gives you a kind of surety that you can restore the functionality of your website as usual.\n\nConclusion\n\nMaintenance of any website is crucial and ensures its smooth functionality. No matter what type of website you have, you need to opt for a reliable website maintenance company that can promise you to deliver the best services.', '{\"v\":1,\"rows\":[{\"cols\":[{\"widgets\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>No matter how good your website is, it will not perform as per your expectation unless you keep it up to date from time to time. Here the role of a website maintenance company becomes essential. A website maintenance company is responsible for making the necessary changes to make your website fully functional and high performing. And thus help your business grow tremendously. Chennai is the best place to find renowned website development companies. So, if you are looking for a website maintenance company in Chennai, you are in the right place to find the best one. Let’s explore some of the top-rated website maintenance company in Chennai. Take a look.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"<strong>Related Links:</strong>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><strong><a href=\\\"https://www.sunsys.in/top-5-best-web-hosting-companies-in-india\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Top 5 Best Web Hosting Companies in India</a></strong></p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Top 5 Website Maintenance Companies in Chennai\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"1. Sunsys\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>While talking about some of the best website maintenance companies in Chennai, Sunsys comes first. The company provides website maintenance services in Chennai to keep your website alive. It offers world-class website support services, which help you achieve your business goal successfully. No matter what type of website maintenance services you seek to opt for, Sunsys is the right place for you. The company has a group of experts who analyze website links, speed, images, performance, etc. They check your website for bugs and then resolve issues immediately. It understands the expectations of customers and renders a comprehensive solution to match their core issues. It follows a simple process of website maintenance and helps your website function flawlessly. <strong>Features of Website Maintenance Services</strong></p>\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":true,\"items\":[\"Website &amp; Performance Analysis\",\"Content and Backend\",\"Updates and Improvements\",\"Quality and Performance Check\",\"Safety and Security\",\"24/7 Tech Support\"]},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"2. JB Soft System\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>JB Soft System lets your website function smoothly in today’s fast-paced competitive world and ensures its robust performance in Google and other search engines. The company understands its responsibility as a website maintenance service provider and never leaves any stone unturned to deliver the best-in-class website maintenance services. It serves web maintenance as a main service and takes full responsibility to maintain your website with the necessary attention. As one of the reliable website maintenance service providers, JB Soft System understands its prime responsibility and care for your website by managing it with a completely professional touch. Be it regaining the website’s originality, maintaining hosting, support for minor updates, or updating on-page details, the company offers necessary website support services in Chennai to match your expectations.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"3. Spidergems\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Spidergems is another website maintenance company in Chennai that you can consider hiring. It makes the content of your website relevant and resolves various necessary issues. It updates your website regularly to keep it fresh, up-to-date, and fully functional. If you own an eCommerce website, you can expect the company to add some new products to your website regularly. Spidergems is the right option for those who are looking to hire a website maintenance company in Chennai at affordable prices. Whether you want to pay on an annual, quarterly, or monthly basis, you can pay the company for its maintenance services at your convenience. It offers a fully flexible plan based on the needs of clients.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"4. Raga Designers\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Raga Designers is another company that offers website maintenance services at affordable costs. The company serves as your best team for website maintenance and does everything to match your expectations. Since its inception, the company has been serving clients with website maintenance services. It provides website maintenance services aiming to reduce your stress. The company ensures that your website performs well and contributes a lot to help your business grow tremendously. Its professionals analyze your website daily for ensuring the better health of your website. Raga Designers specializes in offering a range of services such as CMS Updates, regular testing, content updates, database maintenance, fixing and analyzing website maintenance, and many more.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"5. Legend IT Solutions\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Legend IT Solutions understands the importance of a website for any business. Website is essential to transform the day-to-day function of your business. It makes your business growing and successful by keeping your website updated. It works with the primary goal of letting your website visitors return, up-to-date, accurate, and also in sync with the latest trends. Whether you want to hire a company for web page updates, website analysis, copywriting, image editing, or online marketing, Legend IT Solutions can be your right destination.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Why Website Maintenance is Important for Online Business\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><em>Now, let’s discuss here some valid reasons that make website maintenance more important for your online business.</em></p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"1. Improve Brand Reputation\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Improving brand reputation is something that is a primary aim of any business. It ensures the growth of your online business. If you have a poorly maintained website, it adversely impacts the growth of your business. You should understand that outdated information, lack of responsiveness, or broken links can hurt your website and visitors. Regular website maintenance ensures a professional and polished online presence of your website. A strong brand reputation is necessary to increase customer loyalty, and a competitive market edge, etc.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"2. SEO Monitoring\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Search engine optimization is important to improve the online presence of your website. It helps you increase sales, conversion, and ROI and thus helps your business grow. It helps you analyze your website’s rank, traffic, backlinks, etc. With SEO monitoring, you can find out several potential issues and can take several steps to resolve them. It helps you track progress over time and thus helps you determine the growth of your business.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"3. Boosts Traffic\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>To provide the best quality of content to searchers, search engines like Google improve the ranking of your websites regularly. A website maintenance service provider increases the ranking of your website. They update your website regularly along with several other activities such as fixing broken links, updating the website with relevant information, updating content, removing duplicate pages, etc.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"4. Improve User Experience\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Another reason for hiring a website maintenance service is it helps improve user experience. If you update your website with regular content, it gives you a complete idea about sharable content including image galleries, upcoming events, blogs, etc. These are something that gives an idea to the audience about your website. A well-maintained website is necessary to promote your brand and help you achieve your business objective.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Top 5 Features of Website Maintenance\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"1. Update Software\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Websites are developed with the use of several software components including plugins, content management systems (CMS), frameworks, themes, etc. So, a software update is one of the most prominent features of a website maintenance service. It includes various updates such as security patches, bug fixing, etc.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"2. Testing for Browser Compatibility\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>It’s another crucial feature of website maintenance. All you need to do is to make sure that your website functions properly in some common browsers. A website maintenance service provider tests your browser for compatibility.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"3. Update Content Regularly\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>As mentioned, a regular content update is necessary to keep your website fresh, relevant, and engaging. It includes updating blog posts, images, videos, news articles, and also several other content elements. Fresh content is essential to provide complete value to your website and thus improve your search engine rankings.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"4. Performance Optimization\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>If your website loads slowly, it leads to a poor user experience and thus minimizes search engine rankings. Website maintenance is a combination of compressing images, optimizing codes, minifying CSS, and JavaScript files, and also implementing various caching mechanisms. These actions help improve the performance of your website.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"5. Backup and Disaster Recovery\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>You need to back up your website regularly if you have any unforeseen events including hacking attempts, website crashes, accidental data loss, and more. Website maintenance is a process of setting up a completely automated backup system, which can save copies of your files and also database. It gives you a kind of surety that you can restore the functionality of your website as usual.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Conclusion\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Maintenance of any website is crucial and ensures its smooth functionality. No matter what type of website you have, you need to opt for a reliable website maintenance company that can promise you to deliver the best services.</p>\"}]}]}]}', 'Website Maintenance Company in Chennai', 'We have listed top website maintenance company in Chennai, compare the pricing and features with various top service provider to maintain your website.', '/uploads/blog/202410-bd854a81cea9e40c.png', (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'website-maintenance'), 'draft', '2024-10-16 03:00:56', '2024-10-16 03:00:56', '2025-10-17 07:24:17');
INSERT IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, body, blocks, meta_title, meta_description, cover, category_id, status, published_at, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('top-5-free-website-speed-test-tools', 'Top 5 Free Website Speed Test Tools', 'Online users have less patience to wait for any website that takes a huge time to load. They often avoid visiting these websites, which negatively impacts the performance of the website. A slow websi…', 'Online users have less patience to wait for any website that takes a huge time to load. They often avoid visiting these websites, which negatively impacts the performance of the website. A slow website not only minimizes potential customers but also can affect its search engine rankings.\n\nTherefore, it’s important to make sure that your website is fully optimized for speed. Your website should be lightweight and should not take more than 3 seconds to load.\n\nBut, the question is, how will you test the speed of your website?\n\nWell, there are numerous tools you will come across to check the speed of your website. These tools not only help you check the speed of your website but also help you find areas of improvement as well.\n\nBefore we discuss here several free website speed test tools to check the website’s speed, let’s discuss some basics.\n\nRelated Links:\n\nHeadless Commerce\n\nWhy Website Speed is Highly Important\n\nWebsite speed is all about the time that your website takes to load and display content in front of users. This makes it clear how the loading speed of any website plays a vital role in improving the user experience. As mentioned, a good website speed is highly important for SEO and thus the online success of any business.\n\nMany studies already revealed that even a one-second delay in loading any website results in a significant decrease in sales, conversion, and revenue. If any website loads slowly, it makes visitors impatient and they leave the website in the middle of its loading, which increases its bounce rate as well. And we all are aware of the fact that a higher bounce rate is not good for search engine optimization.\n\nOn the contrary, those websites that load fast can easily attract and engage users and thus improve the performance of websites with a higher conversion rate.\n\nTop 5 Free Website Speed Test Tools\n\nNow let’s discuss here some of the popular free website speed test tools that help you test the overall loading speed of your website along with their features. With the help of these tools, you can explore crucial insights along with various actionable recommendations that help you improve them. Be it a developer, website owner, or digital marketer, anyone can leverage this tool to check the speed of a website with an improved experience.\n\n1.  Google Page Speed Insight\n\nWhile talking about some of the tools to check a website’s speed, it’s vital to start with none other than Google PageSpeed Insights. Since the tool is from Google, you have every reason to trust its result. With the use of the tool, you can get a detailed insight into the speed and performance of your website.\n\nBe it a desktop or mobile version, Google Page Speed Insight is capable of measuring both versions of your website. It yields scores ranging from 0 to 100. The tool also provides you with certain recommendations to enhance the performance of your website.\n\nMore and more, it also provides certain valuable suggestions in terms of the way of optimizing images, leveraging browsing cache, and also minimizing server response time.\n\nFeatures\n\nPerformance metrics\nScoring for page speed\nSuggestion for optimization\nUser experience analysis\n\n2. WebPage Test\n\nIt’s another website speed testing tool that you can consider using for getting a complete analysis of the performance of your website. It targets different locations worldwide when it comes to measuring the speed and performance of your website and provides you with detailed reports accordingly.\n\nApart from this, it also provides numerous recommendations to enhance the performance of your website, including compressing files, optimizing images, and also reducing HTTP requests.\n\nFeatures\n\nMonitor the website for mobile performance\nDetermine layout shifts in the filmstrip view\nRecommendation and scoring\nLargest contentful paint\n\n3. GTmetrix\n\nGTmetrix is another reliable tool that you can try to check the speed of your website. All you need to do is to enter the URL of your website to get the complete report along with the performance grade.\n\nIt lets you check the full load time of your website and also several issues that you should address and the types of resources that consume the most server load.\nFor instance, if the tool highlights issues that need to be fixed for your website to avoid enormous pay loading, it also gives you a complete list of URLs on your website that you need to fix.\n\nGTmetrix works similarly to Page Speed Insights and also reflects whether you fail or pass Google’s Web Core Vitals. With the tool, you can test your website on a range of devices and also browser combinations.\n\nFeatures\n\nGT Alerts\nActivity dashboard\nData visualization\nReal-time analytics\nPerformance metrics\nVirtual analytics\nReal-time data\n\n4. YSlow\n\nYSlow is another free tool to check a website’s speed, which is capable of measuring the loading speed of your website with higher accuracy. It gives you a detailed report and also performance grades ranging from A to F. As one of the leading tools, it also provides various recommendations for enhancing the performance of the website.\n\nFeatures\n\nGet suggestions to improve page performance\nGrading for a web page based on the user-defined or predefined rule set\nSummarize page components\nDisplay page statistics\nTools for performance analysis\n\n5. Pingdom\n\nPingdom is another reliable tool that provides a complete suite of multiple website monitoring tools including a Website Speed Test tool, Application Monitoring tool, and Uptime Monitoring tool.\n\nThe website Speed Test of Pingdom is one of the most interesting tools, which helps users analyze websites from different parts of the world. For instance, you will be able to test the way your website performs for users living in different places across the world.\n\nWhen you enter the URL of your website in this tool, it looks up information regarding your hosting, DNS, and the web server. It also helps you get a website grade along with a score that ranges from 0 to 100. The score works as an indication in terms of where your website stands actually when compared to your competitors.\n\nPingdom also gives you detailed actionable insight in terms of various measures that you can take to improve the speed of your website. It lets you see various important things including unnecessary redirects, images that should be compressed, and various HTTP requests.\n\nYou can also use Pingdom with other tools present in the list to gather deeper insights in terms of improvement areas of your website. It’s available with paid service as well, which monitors your website constantly and prevents it from dangerous situations.\n\nFeatures\n\nTransaction monitoring\nAnalyze root causes\nMonitor page speed\nSend immediate alerts\nUptime monitoring\n\nConclusion\n\nAny website can’t become successful without having a fast loading speed. Above are some of the most prominent tools to check a website’s speed. Each of these tools includes its own set of advantages and disadvantages. So, it’s advisable to use a combination of these tools to do a comprehensive analysis of the performance of your website.', '{\"v\":1,\"rows\":[{\"cols\":[{\"widgets\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Online users have less patience to wait for any website that takes a huge time to load. They often avoid visiting these websites, which negatively impacts the performance of the website. A slow website not only minimizes potential customers but also can affect its search engine rankings.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Therefore, it’s important to make sure that your website is fully optimized for speed. Your website should be lightweight and should not take more than 3 seconds to load.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>But, the question is, how will you test the speed of your website?</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Well, there are numerous tools you will come across to check the speed of your website. These tools not only help you check the speed of your website but also help you find areas of improvement as well.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Before we discuss here several free website speed test tools to check the website’s speed, let’s discuss some basics.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"<strong>Related Links:</strong>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><strong><a href=\\\"https://www.sunsys.in/headless-commerce\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Headless Commerce</a></strong></p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Why Website Speed is Highly Important\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Website speed is all about the time that your website takes to load and display content in front of users. This makes it clear how the loading speed of any website plays a vital role in improving the user experience. As mentioned, a good website speed is highly important for SEO and thus the online success of any business.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Many studies already revealed that even a one-second delay in loading any website results in a significant decrease in sales, conversion, and revenue. If any website loads slowly, it makes visitors impatient and they leave the website in the middle of its loading, which increases its bounce rate as well. And we all are aware of the fact that a higher bounce rate is not good for search engine optimization.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>On the contrary, those websites that load fast can easily attract and engage users and thus improve the performance of websites with a higher conversion rate.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Top 5 Free Website Speed Test Tools\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Now let’s discuss here some of the popular free website speed test tools that help you test the overall loading speed of your website along with their features. With the help of these tools, you can explore crucial insights along with various actionable recommendations that help you improve them. Be it a developer, website owner, or digital marketer, anyone can leverage this tool to check the speed of a website with an improved experience.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"1.  Google Page Speed Insight\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>While talking about some of the tools to check a website’s speed, it’s vital to start with none other than Google PageSpeed Insights. Since the tool is from Google, you have every reason to trust its result. With the use of the tool, you can get a detailed insight into the speed and performance of your website.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Be it a desktop or mobile version, Google Page Speed Insight is capable of measuring both versions of your website. It yields scores ranging from 0 to 100. The tool also provides you with certain recommendations to enhance the performance of your website.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>More and more, it also provides certain valuable suggestions in terms of the way of optimizing images, leveraging browsing cache, and also minimizing server response time.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><strong>Features</strong></p>\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":true,\"items\":[\"Performance metrics\",\"Scoring for page speed\",\"Suggestion for optimization\",\"User experience analysis\"]},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"2. WebPage Test\"},{\"type\":\