lytics\",\"Performance metrics\",\"Virtual analytics\",\"Real-time data\"]},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"4. YSlow\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>YSlow is another free tool to check a website’s speed, which is capable of measuring the loading speed of your website with higher accuracy. It gives you a detailed report and also performance grades ranging from A to F. As one of the leading tools, it also provides various recommendations for enhancing the performance of the website.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><strong>Features</strong></p>\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":true,\"items\":[\"Get suggestions to improve page performance\",\"Grading for a web page based on the user-defined or predefined rule set\",\"Summarize page components\",\"Display page statistics\",\"Tools for performance analysis\"]},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"5. Pingdom\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Pingdom is another reliable tool that provides a complete suite of multiple website monitoring tools including a Website Speed Test tool, Application Monitoring tool, and Uptime Monitoring tool.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>The website Speed Test of Pingdom is one of the most interesting tools, which helps users analyze websites from different parts of the world. For instance, you will be able to test the way your website performs for users living in different places across the world.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>When you enter the URL of your website in this tool, it looks up information regarding your hosting, DNS, and the web server. It also helps you get a website grade along with a score that ranges from 0 to 100. The score works as an indication in terms of where your website stands actually when compared to your competitors.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Pingdom also gives you detailed actionable insight in terms of various measures that you can take to improve the speed of your website. It lets you see various important things including unnecessary redirects, images that should be compressed, and various HTTP requests.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>You can also use Pingdom with other tools present in the list to gather deeper insights in terms of improvement areas of your website. It’s available with paid service as well, which monitors your website constantly and prevents it from dangerous situations.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><strong>Features</strong></p>\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":true,\"items\":[\"Transaction monitoring\",\"Analyze root causes\",\"Monitor page speed\",\"Send immediate alerts\",\"Uptime monitoring\"]},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Conclusion\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Any website can’t become successful without having a fast loading speed. Above are some of the most prominent tools to check a website’s speed. Each of these tools includes its own set of advantages and disadvantages. So, it’s advisable to use a combination of these tools to do a comprehensive analysis of the performance of your website.</p>\"}]}]}]}', 'Top 5 Free Website Speed Test Tools', 'There are several free website speed test tools available that can help you analyze and measure the performance of your website. Here are some popular ones', '/uploads/blog/202410-f8e11aa059d06e12.webp', (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'website-maintenance'), 'published', '2024-10-16 03:02:28', '2024-10-16 03:02:28', '2025-03-03 04:14:56');
INSERT IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, body, blocks, meta_title, meta_description, cover, category_id, status, published_at, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('headless-commerce', 'Headless Commerce', 'Thanks to the advent of automated software, eCommerce has never been easier. Now you can set up your store and work on other projects while your shop is automatically updated with new listings. But h…', 'Thanks to the advent of automated software, eCommerce has never been easier. Now you can set up your store and work on other projects while your shop is automatically updated with new listings. But headless eCommerce is still a relatively new phenomenon and customers are not quite sure how to go about shopping online without a customer service rep or if they will be able to return items if need be.\n\nRelated Links:\n\nTop 5 Free Website Speed Test Tools\n\n1. What is Headless commerce?\n\nHeadless commerce is a new way of shopping that allows customers to purchase products without ever seeing or interacting with the merchant’s website. Instead, headless commerce applications use web hooks to send purchase information directly to the customer’s preferred eCommerce platform. This allows merchants to improve their customer experience and increase product sales by cutting out the need for customer interaction.\n\nHeadless commerce apps are available in several different formats, including web applications, desktop applications, and mobile apps. Some headless commerce platforms also allow merchants to integrate with other eCommerce platforms, such as Shopify and Amazon.com.\n\nThere are several advantages to using headless commerce apps. First, they enable merchants to focus on their product offerings rather than on website design and maintenance. Second, headless commerce apps can reduce overhead costs by allowing merchants to use existing eCommerce platforms. Third, headless commerce apps can help merchants reach new customers who are not online or who do not have access to traditional internet browsers. Finally, headless commerce apps can help merchants increase sales by providing a more efficient way for customers to buy products.\n\n2. How headless commerce works?\n\nHeadless Commerce is a new trend in online shopping that allows shoppers to shop without ever having to view or interact with a web page. This type of shopping is becoming increasingly popular as it eliminates the need for customers to download and use shopping carts, browse product descriptions, or fill out checkout forms.\n\nHeadless commerce technology works by automatically handling all of these tasks for shoppers, so they can focus on what matters most – finding the items they want and buying them without any interference from the website.One of the benefits of headless commerce is that it can save shoppers time and money. Shopping heedlessly eliminates the need to search for a shopping cart, fill it out, and then click submit.\n\nShopping heedlessly also allows customers to browse products without being distracted by lengthy product descriptions or complicated checkout forms. Instead, headless commerce technology will automatically gather all of the customer’s information and complete the checkout process for them. This saves customers time and energy, which can be put towards more important things like finding a product they want to buy. Another benefit of headless commerce is that it can benefited for small businesses  reach more shoppers. Many small businesses struggle to get their products in front of the right consumers, but head.\n\n3. Benefits of Headless Commerce\n\nThere are many benefits to using headless eCommerce, including:\n\n1. Reduced development time and complexity\n2. Enhanced security and privacy\n3. Efficient website performance\n4. Improved customer experience\n\nSome of the most important reasons to consider headless Commerce are its potential benefits to your business. By moving away from traditional web architecture, you can reduce development time and complexity, as well as improve security and privacy. Additionally, headless Commerce can result in improved website performance due to the elimination of unnecessary processes and traffic. Finally, headless eCommerce can provide a better customer experience by streamlining the ordering process and reducing wait times. Overall, these advantages can have a significant impact on your business’s bottom line.\n\n4. Headless Commerce Platform vs Traditional eCommerce\n\nTraditional eCommerce involves browsing through products and selecting the one you want to purchase. Headless commerce, in contrast, eliminates the need for a user to view products in a catalog or on a website. Instead, headless commerce uses artificial intelligence (AI) to make product recommendations to customers based on their preferences.\n\nThis technology can be used in conjunction with other headless technologies such as voice assistants and facial recognition software. This type of commerce has numerous advantages over traditional eCommerce. First, it is faster and more efficient because there is no need for users to scroll through pages of products. Second, it is more personalized because AI can learn customer preferences over time.\n\nFinally, it is more secure because users cannot accidentally input personal information into headless commerce systems. While headless commerce has many advantages, it faces some challenges. For example, customers may not be familiar with this type of technology and may find it difficult to use. Additionally, headless commerce systems may not be available in all locations or at all price points, which could limit their appeal. However, these obstacles may eventually be overcome as headless commerce becomes more widespread.\n\n5. The Drawback of Headless Commerce\n\nHeadless eCommerce is a trend that has been growing in popularity since it was first introduced in 2017. Headless eCommerce is a way of shopping where the user does not need to see or interact with the product they are buying. This can be beneficial for people who are shy or have anxiety issues. However, headless commerce has its drawbacks.\n\nThe biggest drawback of headless commerce is that it can be difficult to find information about the products you are purchasing. This can be problematic if you are not sure whether you should purchase a product or not. Additionally, headless eCommerce can lead to buying mistakes. If you are not able to see the product you are buying, it can be difficult to determine the size or color. This can lead to purchasing an incorrect product that you will have to return or regret later on.\n\nDespite these drawbacks, headless eCommerce is growing in popularity because of its benefits. If you are looking for an alternative way to shop, headless commerce may be a good option for you.\n\nConclusion\n\nIf you’re looking to take your eCommerce business to the next level, then headless shopping is a great way to do it. Headless shopping essentially means that you don’t have a head of inventory that needs to be managed and tracked. Instead, all of your products are stored in an online retail store and bought automatically when customers place an order. This can save you a lot of time and money, so if you’re ready to make some serious changes to your eCommerce business, then headless shopping is something worth considering.', '{\"v\":1,\"rows\":[{\"cols\":[{\"widgets\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Thanks to the advent of automated software, eCommerce has never been easier. Now you can set up your store and work on other projects while your shop is automatically updated with new listings. But headless eCommerce is still a relatively new phenomenon and customers are not quite sure how to go about shopping online without a customer service rep or if they will be able to return items if need be.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"<strong>Related Links:</strong>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><strong><a href=\\\"https://www.sunsys.in/top-5-free-website-speed-test-tools\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Top 5 Free Website Speed Test Tools</a></strong></p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"1. What is Headless commerce?\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Headless commerce is a new way of shopping that allows customers to purchase products without ever seeing or interacting with the merchant’s website. Instead, headless commerce applications use web hooks to send purchase information directly to the customer’s preferred eCommerce platform. This allows merchants to improve their customer experience and increase product sales by cutting out the need for customer interaction.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Headless commerce apps are available in several different formats, including web applications, desktop applications, and mobile apps. Some headless commerce platforms also allow merchants to integrate with other eCommerce platforms, such as Shopify and Amazon.com.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>There are several advantages to using headless commerce apps. First, they enable merchants to focus on their product offerings rather than on website design and maintenance. Second, headless commerce apps can reduce overhead costs by allowing merchants to use existing eCommerce platforms. Third, headless commerce apps can help merchants reach new customers who are not online or who do not have access to traditional internet browsers. Finally, headless commerce apps can help merchants increase sales by providing a more efficient way for customers to buy products.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"2. How headless commerce works?\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Headless Commerce is a new trend in online shopping that allows shoppers to shop without ever having to view or interact with a web page. This type of shopping is becoming increasingly popular as it eliminates the need for customers to download and use shopping carts, browse product descriptions, or fill out checkout forms.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Headless commerce technology works by automatically handling all of these tasks for shoppers, so they can focus on what matters most – finding the items they want and buying them without any interference from the website.One of the benefits of headless commerce is that it can save shoppers time and money. Shopping heedlessly eliminates the need to search for a shopping cart, fill it out, and then click submit.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Shopping heedlessly also allows customers to browse products without being distracted by lengthy product descriptions or complicated checkout forms. Instead, headless commerce technology will automatically gather all of the customer’s information and complete the checkout process for them. This saves customers time and energy, which can be put towards more important things like finding a product they want to buy. Another benefit of headless commerce is that it can <a href=\\\"https://www.sunsys.in/top-10-benefits-of-ecommerce-for-small-business\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">benefited for small businesses</a>  reach more shoppers. Many small businesses struggle to get their products in front of the right consumers, but head.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"3. Benefits of Headless Commerce\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>There are many benefits to using headless eCommerce, including:</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>1. Reduced development time and complexity<br>2. Enhanced security and privacy<br>3. Efficient website performance<br>4. Improved customer experience</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Some of the most important reasons to consider headless Commerce are its potential benefits to your business. By moving away from traditional web architecture, you can reduce development time and complexity, as well as improve security and privacy. Additionally, headless Commerce can result in improved website performance due to the elimination of unnecessary processes and traffic. Finally, headless eCommerce can provide a better customer experience by streamlining the ordering process and reducing wait times. Overall, these advantages can have a significant impact on your business’s bottom line.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"4. Headless Commerce Platform vs Traditional eCommerce\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Traditional eCommerce involves browsing through products and selecting the one you want to purchase. Headless commerce, in contrast, eliminates the need for a user to view products in a catalog or on a website. Instead, headless commerce uses artificial intelligence (AI) to make product recommendations to customers based on their preferences.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>This technology can be used in conjunction with other headless technologies such as voice assistants and facial recognition software. This type of commerce has numerous advantages over traditional eCommerce. First, it is faster and more efficient because there is no need for users to scroll through pages of products. Second, it is more personalized because AI can learn customer preferences over time.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Finally, it is more secure because users cannot accidentally input personal information into headless commerce systems. While headless commerce has many advantages, it faces some challenges. For example, customers may not be familiar with this type of technology and may find it difficult to use. Additionally, headless commerce systems may not be available in all locations or at all price points, which could limit their appeal. However, these obstacles may eventually be overcome as headless commerce becomes more widespread.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"5. The Drawback of Headless Commerce\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Headless eCommerce is a trend that has been growing in popularity since it was first introduced in 2017. Headless eCommerce is a way of shopping where the user does not need to see or interact with the product they are buying. This can be beneficial for people who are shy or have anxiety issues. However, headless commerce has its drawbacks.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>The biggest drawback of headless commerce is that it can be difficult to find information about the products you are purchasing. This can be problematic if you are not sure whether you should purchase a product or not. Additionally, headless eCommerce can lead to buying mistakes. If you are not able to see the product you are buying, it can be difficult to determine the size or color. This can lead to purchasing an incorrect product that you will have to return or regret later on.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Despite these drawbacks, headless eCommerce is growing in popularity because of its benefits. If you are looking for an alternative way to shop, headless commerce may be a good option for you.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Conclusion\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>If you’re looking to take your eCommerce business to the next level, then headless shopping is a great way to do it. Headless shopping essentially means that you don’t have a head of inventory that needs to be managed and tracked. Instead, all of your products are stored in an online retail store and bought automatically when customers place an order. This can save you a lot of time and money, so if you’re ready to make some serious changes to your eCommerce business, then headless shopping is something worth considering.</p>\"}]}]}]}', 'Headless commerce and its Benefits', 'lets drive into new age of ecommerce business. know about Headless commerce and its Benefits , comparison between headless and traditional ecommerce platforms.', '/uploads/blog/202410-1744fd2827bd3bb3.webp', (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'website-maintenance'), 'published', '2024-10-16 03:06:49', '2024-10-16 03:06:49', '2025-03-03 04:16:05');
INSERT IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, body, blocks, meta_title, meta_description, cover, category_id, status, published_at, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('what-does-website-maintenance-services-include', 'What does website maintenance services include?', 'No matter what business you operate, it deserves to have an outstanding website. Once you launch your website successfully, you still need to keep your eyes on it through the website performing well.…', 'Overview\n\nNo matter what business you operate, it deserves to have an outstanding website. Once you launch your website successfully, you still need to keep your eyes on it through the website performing well. You need to understand the fact that your business website is just like a car.\n\nWhen you buy a new car, you also need to think about its maintenance and change the spare parts from time to time to improve its performance. In the same way, your website also needs maintenance. Since you invest a lot of your hard-earned money in developing your business website, it’s your responsibility to care for it perfectly.\n\nYou should monitor, optimize, and update your website with perfection to take its performance to the optimum level. You need a perfect plan for your website maintenance when it comes to allocating money; time and enough skill to maintain it.\n\nHere, we will discuss what is included in web maintenance plan. But, before this, it’s crucial to delve into the basics. Take a look.\n\nRelated Links:\n\nHow to choose website maintenance Company for business\n\nWhat is a Website Maintenance Plan?\n\nAs the name suggests, a website maintenance plan serves its ultimate goal to maintain and offer the required support to maintain the function and performance of a website. It’s the ongoing support that any website needs to perform well. A website maintenance professional is concerned about performing in-depth work compared to people who can make time to gather information regarding how to do it perfectly. So, most entrepreneurs nowadays hire professional website maintenance and support companies to make their websites high performing. When you hire a website maintenance service provider, they will analyze your website to check whether it performs well or not. If they identify any issues, they take immediate action to resolve the same. They are responsible for keeping your website highly responsive and updated to ensure its relevance with the latest changing trends. With regular maintenance by professionals, you will be able to keep your website secure, up to date, and highly reliable. It improves the SEO of your website and also improves its ranking in search engines.\n\nWhat is Included in the Website Maintenance Plan?\n\nWell, if you are hiring a website maintenance plan for your business website, you must be aware of what the service includes. We are going to describe various elements of the web maintenance plan.\n\n1. Check for Vulnerabilities\n\nSecurity is the most crucial factor that improves the usability of your website and thus improves its reliability among customers. Irrespective of the type of website you have, it should have cutting-edge security features.\n\nSo, you should understand that security is a key reason why you need to opt for website maintenance services. Website maintenance professionals always analyze spam on your website. They check vulnerability regularly and thus also ensure your website is not under the threat of hackers.\n\n2. Fixing and Repairing\n\nThis is another reason why you need to opt for professional website maintenance, repairing, and support services. They identify bugs, errors, and also several broken links. Checking both external and internal links is indeed quite necessary. A professional maintenance service provider always checks the broken link of your website through various specialized tools.\n\nBroken links of your website not only make an adverse impact on user experience but also affect search engine optimization of your website.\n\n3. Update Software\n\nYour website includes important software. You should update it from time to time to let it function properly. When you hire a reputed service provider, they always update software to improve the usability of your website. Apart from this, professionals also update themes, content management systems (CMS), and plugins.\n\n4. Test Browser Compatibility\n\nYou need to always ensure that every crucial aspect of your website functions properly in every browser. Professionals check for browser compatibility of your website on every single browser, be it Chrome, Mozilla Firefox, Safari, Opera, or others.\n\n5. Check for Website Loading Speed\n\nThe loading speed of your website is directly related to user engagement and its success. The most interesting fact is that the website maintenance plan also includes analyzing loading speed through various tools such as Google Page speed Insights, Yahoo’s YSlow, and many others.\n\n6. Website Backups\n\nGetting a complete website backup is quite necessary as it helps you deal with emergencies hassle-free. The website maintenance plan also includes website backups and helps you in achieving your mission successfully.\n\n7. Search Engine Optimization (SEO)\n\nSearch engine optimization is another crucial plan that a website maintenance plan includes. Professionals update your content to keep it fresh and updated, which helps your website perform outstandingly with improved ranking.\n\n8. Check Functionality\n\nThe next thing that your website maintenance plan includes is checking the functionality of your website. Professionals analyze various important functions of your website, be it contact forms, signing forms, checkout forms, or others to check the function of your website.\n\n9. Analytics\n\nOnce you hire a professional website maintenance service provider, they will check analytics on a regular basis to understand user behavior. It helps them get an idea regarding the way users interact with your website, the most engaging elements, etc. It also helps you make your business strategy accordingly.\n\nConclusion\n\nSo, you now have a clear idea of what is a website maintenance plan and also what does included in website maintenance services. When you hire a website maintenance provider, you should discuss in detail what they include with the plan and also additional items. A genuine service provider will match your expectations.', '{\"v\":1,\"rows\":[{\"cols\":[{\"widgets\":[{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Overview\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>No matter what business you operate, it deserves to have an outstanding website. Once you launch your website successfully, you still need to keep your eyes on it through the website performing well. You need to understand the fact that your business website is just like a car.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>When you buy a new car, you also need to think about its maintenance and change the spare parts from time to time to improve its performance. In the same way, your website also needs maintenance. Since you invest a lot of your hard-earned money in developing your business website, it’s your responsibility to care for it perfectly.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>You should monitor, optimize, and update your website with perfection to take its performance to the optimum level. You need a perfect plan for your website maintenance when it comes to allocating money; time and enough skill to maintain it.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Here, we will discuss what is included in web maintenance plan. But, before this, it’s crucial to delve into the basics. Take a look.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"<strong>Related Links:</strong>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><strong><a href=\\\"https://www.sunsys.in/how-to-choose-website-maintenance-company-for-business\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">How to choose website maintenance Company for business</a></strong></p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"What is a Website Maintenance Plan?\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>As the name suggests, a website maintenance plan serves its ultimate goal to maintain and offer the required support to maintain the function and performance of a website. It’s the ongoing support that any website needs to perform well. A website maintenance professional is concerned about performing in-depth work compared to people who can make time to gather information regarding how to do it perfectly. So, most entrepreneurs nowadays hire professional website maintenance and support companies to make their websites high performing. When you hire a <a href=\\\"https://www.sunsys.in/website-maintenance-company-bangalore/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">website maintenance service provider</a>, they will analyze your website to check whether it performs well or not. If they identify any issues, they take immediate action to resolve the same. They are responsible for keeping your website highly responsive and updated to ensure its relevance with the latest changing trends. With regular maintenance by professionals, you will be able to keep your website secure, up to date, and highly reliable. It improves the SEO of your website and also improves its ranking in search engines.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"What is Included in the Website Maintenance Plan?\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Well, if you are hiring a website maintenance plan for your business website, you must be aware of what the service includes. We are going to describe various elements of the web maintenance plan.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"1. Check for Vulnerabilities\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Security is the most crucial factor that improves the usability of your website and thus improves its reliability among customers. Irrespective of the type of website you have, it should have cutting-edge security features.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>So, you should understand that security is a key reason why you need to opt for website maintenance services. Website maintenance professionals always analyze spam on your website. They check vulnerability regularly and thus also ensure your website is not under the threat of hackers.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"2. Fixing and Repairing\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>This is another reason why you need to opt for professional website maintenance, repairing, and support services. They identify bugs, errors, and also several broken links. Checking both external and internal links is indeed quite necessary. A professional maintenance service provider always checks the broken link of your website through various specialized tools.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Broken links of your website not only make an adverse impact on user experience but also affect search engine optimization of your website.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"3. Update Software\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Your website includes important software. You should update it from time to time to let it function properly. When you hire a reputed service provider, they always update software to improve the usability of your website. Apart from this, professionals also update themes, content management systems (CMS), and plugins.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"4. Test Browser Compatibility\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>You need to always ensure that every crucial aspect of your website functions properly in every browser. Professionals check for browser compatibility of your website on every single browser, be it Chrome, Mozilla Firefox, Safari, Opera, or others.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"5. Check for Website Loading Speed\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>The loading speed of your website is directly related to user engagement and its success. The most interesting fact is that the website maintenance plan also includes analyzing loading speed through various tools such as Google Page speed Insights, Yahoo’s YSlow, and many others.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"6. Website Backups\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Getting a complete website backup is quite necessary as it helps you deal with emergencies hassle-free. The website maintenance plan also includes website backups and helps you in achieving your mission successfully.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"7. Search Engine Optimization (SEO)\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Search engine optimization is another crucial plan that a website maintenance plan includes. Professionals update your content to keep it fresh and updated, which helps your website perform outstandingly with improved ranking.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"8. Check Functionality\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>The next thing that your website maintenance plan includes is checking the functionality of your website. Professionals analyze various important functions of your website, be it contact forms, signing forms, checkout forms, or others to check the function of your website.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"9. Analytics\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Once you hire a professional website maintenance service provider, they will check analytics on a regular basis to understand user behavior. It helps them get an idea regarding the way users interact with your website, the most engaging elements, etc. It also helps you make your business strategy accordingly.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Conclusion\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>So, you now have a clear idea of what is a website maintenance plan and also what does included in website maintenance services. When you hire a website maintenance provider, you should discuss in detail what they include with the plan and also additional items. A genuine service provider will match your expectations.</p>\"}]}]}]}', 'What does website maintenance services include?', 'There are many website maintenance services plans you can get in web development industry, But choosing a best plan for business is quiet difficult. So we done out best research to provide answer for what does website maintenance services include.', '/uploads/blog/202410-5430789eec0666b8.webp', (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'website-maintenance'), 'published', '2024-10-16 03:07:54', '2024-10-16 03:07:54', '2025-03-03 04:12:03');
INSERT IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, body, blocks, meta_title, meta_description, cover, category_id, status, published_at, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('how-to-choose-website-maintenance-company-for-business', 'How to choose website maintenance Company for business', 'So, you have already developed a new website for your business and made it live. Well, you have taken a decisive step. You have every reason to be happy. Now, you might be thinking that your job is o…', 'Overview\n\nSo, you have already developed a new website for your business and made it live. Well, you have taken a decisive step. You have every reason to be happy. Now, you might be thinking that your job is over as your business website is online. Unfortunately, it’s not the case.\n\nIt’s just half of the battle you won. The reason is your website tends to be outdated with time. As a result, your website will lose traffic and conversion rate. Therefore, your business will be impacted adversely. So, to avoid any such situation, it’s necessary to hire reputed website maintenance services for your business.\n\nWebsite maintenance professionals will take care of your website and will update it with the latest technological innovation, OS updates, changes in user behavior, and many others.\n\nA professional website maintenance company works with a proven strategy to keep your website updated and make it high-performing for the long term. They will make your website future-proof and user engaging.\n\nRelated Links:\n\nWhat does website maintenance services include?\n\nWhy Should You Hire a Web Maintenance Company?\n\nWell, let’s discuss here several benefits of hiring for website maintenance and support plans.\nOnce you hire a professional website maintenance service provider, you will get a group of website maintenance experts who create an impeccable website maintenance strategy.\nHiring website maintenance services prevent you from spending your valuable time on maintaining your website and let you focus on some of the other essential works in your business.\nWebsite maintenance professionals keep themselves versed with the latest innovations and changes in trends and implement your website accordingly.\nA reputed website maintenance service provider focuses on keeping your website highly secured. They update your website by implementing cutting-edge security features.\nWebsite maintenance experts update the content of your website periodically and keep it fresh and engaging for users. Besides, it also helps your website rank in search engines and thus helps your business grow at a fast pace.\nThese professionals keep analyzing the performance of your website and take the necessary actions to update your website and improve its performance.\n\nTips To Hire Web Maintenance Company for Your Business\n\nIndeed, choosing the right website development company is not an easy task and you will face a lot of problems. We will discuss here various tips that will give you ideas on how to choose website maintenance company for business.\n\n1. Know your Website Maintenance Requirements\n\nBefore hiring a website maintenance company, you need to first know about your needs, which will give you a better idea to select the right company. You need to understand the fact that every website maintenance service provider offers a range of services and packages.\n\nOnce you are aware of your needs, you will be able to select the right package for your website maintenance. Now, you may be thinking about the way to know your website maintenance needs, right? Well, to understand your needs, you need to ask about the following factors yourself.\n\nWebsite elements that you want to be updated\nWhether you want to write blogs yourself or want your website maintenance service provider to write.\nThe total time you need to spend on maintenance of your business website?\nWhether you wish to do search engine optimization on your own or want your \nservice provider to do the same.\n\n2. Services that Company Offers\n\nNow, you are already aware of the importance of a website Maintenance Company for your business. Therefore, it’s necessary to find a reliable partner that offers every service that your website needs to be versed with the fast-changing trends and keep it updated.\n\nSuppose you want to hire a full-service maintenance company. In that case, you need to ensure that your company offers various important services such as website speed testing, checking for 404 errors, identifying broken links, software/plugin updates, creating blog content, checking website security, and analyzing website performance, and more.\n\n3. Experience of your Company\n\nExperience is another crucial factor that you should always take into account when hiring a website maintenance service provider. If you hire an experienced maintenance service provider, they will provide you with an experienced team that can maintain your website as per your needs. They will also make a recommendation of several actions that you need to take to boost the performance of your website.\n\nAn experienced and professional team builds a fully comprehensive and custom web maintenance plan for your business.\n\n4. Get Details about Budget\n\nOnce you are aware of the types of services that you need from a website maintenance service provider, it’s time for you to set your budget. When it comes to website maintenance costs, these tend to vary from organization to organization.\n\nThere are a few factors that play a leading role in determining the price of a website maintenance company. You need to consider the size of your organization and also how complex your business website is.\n\nFor instance, if you run a small business and your website is simple, you will be able to pay less compared to a complex website.\n\nConclusion\n\nAfter going through the above discussion, These are the best ways to choose web management agency for business you may now have enough details about the importance of website maintenance and the benefits of hiring a professional company. It also gives you an idea about how to choose website maintenance company for business.', '{\"v\":1,\"rows\":[{\"cols\":[{\"widgets\":[{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Overview\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>So, you have already developed a new website for your business and made it live. Well, you have taken a decisive step. You have every reason to be happy. Now, you might be thinking that your job is over as your business website is online. Unfortunately, it’s not the case.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>It’s just half of the battle you won. The reason is your website tends to be outdated with time. As a result, your website will lose traffic and conversion rate. Therefore, your business will be impacted adversely. So, to avoid any such situation, it’s necessary to hire reputed website maintenance services for your business.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Website maintenance professionals will take care of your website and will update it with the latest technological innovation, OS updates, changes in user behavior, and many others.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>A professional website maintenance company works with a proven strategy to keep your website updated and make it high-performing for the long term. They will make your website future-proof and user engaging.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"<strong>Related Links:</strong>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><strong><a href=\\\"https://www.sunsys.in/what-does-website-maintenance-services-include\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">What does website maintenance services include?</a></strong></p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Why Should You Hire a Web Maintenance Company?\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":true,\"items\":[\"Well, let’s discuss here several benefits of hiring for website maintenance and support plans.\",\"Once you hire a professional website maintenance service provider, you will get a group of website maintenance experts who create an impeccable website maintenance strategy.\",\"Hiring website maintenance services prevent you from spending your valuable time on maintaining your website and let you focus on some of the other essential works in your business.\",\"Website maintenance professionals keep themselves versed with the latest innovations and changes in trends and implement your website accordingly.\",\"A reputed website maintenance service provider focuses on keeping your website highly secured. They update your website by implementing cutting-edge security features.\",\"Website maintenance experts update the content of your website periodically and keep it fresh and engaging for users. Besides, it also helps your website rank in search engines and thus helps your business grow at a fast pace.\",\"These professionals keep analyzing the performance of your website and take the necessary actions to update your website and improve its performance.\"]},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"Tips To Hire Web Maintenance Company for Your Business\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Indeed, choosing the right website development company is not an easy task and you will face a lot of problems. We will discuss here various tips that will give you ideas on how to choose website maintenance company for business.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"1. Know your Website Maintenance Requirements\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Before hiring a website maintenance company, you need to first know about your needs, which will give you a better idea to select the right company. You need to understand the fact that every website maintenance service provider offers a range of services and packages.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Once you are aware of your needs, you will be able to select the right package for your website maintenance. Now, you may be thinking about the way to know your website maintenance needs, right? Well, to understand your needs, you need to ask about the following factors yourself.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":true,\"items\":[\"Website elements that you want to be updated\",\"Whether you want to write blogs yourself or want your website maintenance service provider to write.\",\"The total time you need to spend on maintenance of your business website?\",\"Whether you wish to do search engine optimization on your own or want your <br>service provider to do the same.\"]},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"2. Services that Company Offers\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Now, you are already aware of the importance of a website Maintenance Company for your business. Therefore, it’s necessary to find a reliable partner that offers every service that your website needs to be versed with the fast-changing trends and keep it updated.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Suppose you want to hire a full-service maintenance company. In that case, you need to ensure that your company offers various important services such as website speed testing, checking for 404 errors, identifying broken links, software/plugin updates, creating blog content, checking website security, and analyzing website performance, and more.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"3. Experience of your Company\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Experience is another crucial factor that you should always take into account when hiring a website maintenance service provider. If you hire an experienced maintenance service provider, they will provide you with an experienced team that can maintain your website as per your needs. They will also make a recommendation of several actions that you need to take to boost the performance of your website.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>An experienced and professional team builds a fully comprehensive and custom web maintenance plan for your business.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"4. Get Details about Budget\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Once you are aware of the types of services that you need from a website maintenance service provider, it’s time for you to set your budget. When it comes to website maintenance costs, these tend to vary from organization to organization.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>There are a few factors that play a leading role in determining the price of a website maintenance company. You need to consider the size of your organization and also how complex your business website is.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>For instance, if you run a small business and your website is simple, you will be able to pay less compared to a complex website.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Conclusion\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>After going through the above discussion, These are the best ways to choose web management agency for business you may now have enough details about the importance of website maintenance and the benefits of hiring a professional company. It also gives you an idea about how to choose website maintenance company for business.</p>\"}]}]}]}', 'Tips to choose website maintenance Company for business', 'As a online business owner we may need multiple changes or security updates for our websites. we need proper guidance to manage website. here are some pro tips for how to choose website maintenance company for business.', '/uploads/blog/202410-f70d93f388dd08cc.webp', (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'website-maintenance'), 'published', '2024-10-16 03:11:08', '2024-10-16 03:11:08', '2025-03-03 04:12:48');
INSERT IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, body, blocks, meta_title, meta_description, cover, category_id, status, published_at, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('why-regular-website-maintenance-is-important', 'Why regular website maintenance is important', 'Irrespective of the size of your website, you need to opt for website maintenance and support. Your website represents your business across the world and also helps your customers gather information …', 'Introduction\n\nIrrespective of the size of your website, you need to opt for website maintenance and support. Your website represents your business across the world and also helps your customers gather information and buy your products.But, if your website is not working properly, your customers will not be able to go through your products and services. As a result, it makes an adverse impact on the growth of your business with less conversion, sales, and ROI.A flawless website is necessary for those in many real-time service industries. In today’s time, almost every business needs a website maintenance service whether they are from healthcare, automobile, eCommerce, Information Technology, or others.Hiring professional website maintenance company in India helps businesses in tantalizing the sense of new customers, help retain existing customers, improve SEO, and lots more.We will discuss everything related to why regular website maintenance is important. But, before this, it’s time to take a look at various statistics related to website maintenance services.\n\n1. 68% of websites fail to have a proper recovery plan\n2. 87% of websites face medium or higher cyber security risks\n3. 73.2% of websites use outdated software that makes them prone to security threats\n\nRelated Links:\n\nThe Website Maintenance Checklist – Complete Guide\n\nReasons Why Regular Website Maintenance is Important for Business\n\nWe are going to discuss here some of the top reasons why regular website maintenance tasks is crucial for any business. It gives you an idea of the importance of regular website maintenance.\n\n1. Update Content Regularly\n\nSeveral factors determine the quality of your website – content is one of those. It not only improves the quality of your website but also makes it informative and thus encourages users to engage with it. But, the outdated content will not make your website successful in drawing the attention of users. A regular content update keeps your website fresh and updated for your end users.\n\nA regular content update is also necessary for making your website interesting and also improves its position in search engines. With proper maintenance of your website, you can easily fine-tune content. It’s crucial to analyze phrases, keywords, etc, to get a chance to grab the attention of your website’s visitors. And it can generate higher leads and also can boost your conversion rates.\n\n2. Get Working Backup\n\nOnce you have a regular website maintenance plan to keep your website up to date, it enables you to get a reliable backup if an emergency gets crashed. A working backup helps you deal with any situation by developing your website from scratch.\n\nOnce you hire a professional website maintenance company, they will be responsible for implementing various website elements that include source code including PHP, CSS, HTML, CSS, etc.\n\n3. Protection and Security\n\nSecurity of your website is something that is of great importance as it prevents your website from hackers. When you hire a reputed website maintenance service provider, they will be responsible for performing periodical maintenance. Therefore, professionals can easily identify bugs on your website and then fix them to avert any attacks.\n\nA website maintenance service provider can update your website’s software with the latest version and can also install any available security patches. It also helps you eliminate any kind of security threat that your website can get.\n\nApart from this, a web maintenance strategy is something that also includes the use of fully secure and strong passwords, and removing updated apps. Professional website maintenance service providers ensure the availability of sensitive files on your website.\n\n4. Compatibility with Innovative Technologies\n\nIt’s another reason why you need to opt for regular web maintenance services. With the growing internet world, new technologies and techniques are frequently introduced for improving user experience.\n\nTherefore, any organization with an online presence must analyze regularly while reviewing the compatibility of its website with cutting-edge technologies. For instance, if your website is not mobile-friendly, then there’s a higher possibility that users will face problems accessing your device through mobiles.\n\nSo, your regular website maintenance service provider must analyze your website by leveraging various internet technologies and techniques. It helps you know whether your website is fully compatible with the latest technologies or not.\n\n5. Launch of New Products and Services\n\nYour company often launches new products and services or introduces existing products with new features in the market. In this case, you must make a list of all those products online through your website. It’s one of the ways that a company uses to stay in this competitive market.\n\nSo, you need to have a professional regular website maintenance service provider who gives you surety that your website will never be outdated.\n\n6. Boost User Experience\n\nA professional and effective regular website maintenance plan is necessary for higher lead generation and also enhanced conversion rates. Your website must be capable of matching the expectation of your visitors. If your website functions poorly, it makes an adverse impact on your brand image. As a result, your customers will avoid visiting your website.\n\nSo, all you need to do is to hire a top-rated regular website maintenance company that assists you in dealing with various technical issues that your website faces. Be it poor grammar, broken links, spelling errors, page loading errors, or other issues, website maintenance professionals can do everything to keep your website fully functional.\n\n7. Analyzing and Tracking\n\nIt’s vital to check various important metrics of websites that give you a complete insight into the complete progress of your campaigns. So, you can easily decide on the next plans or strategy for implementation.\n\nIf you observe that your website is not capable of fulfilling your sales goals, it reflects that you should revamp your website with new strategies. It helps you match the sales target.\n\n8. Make Compatible with the Advanced Tools and Algorithms\n\nAnother great advantage of having a top-rated website maintenance service for your business is it ensures compatibility of your website with the latest tools and algorithms. When it comes to search engines, these generally rate your websites quickly and make them fully maintained, error-free, and updated.\n\nTherefore, if you update your website with fresh content, it can easily rank in search engines and will appear on the first page in SERP. To optimize your search engine optimization ranking, you should have an adequate regular website maintenance strategy. It helps your website adjust according to the dynamic search engine algorithms.\n\n9. Brand Image Promotion\n\nYour brand image plays an indispensable role in increasing the market reputation of your organization. And thus, it ensures the success of your business. Be its loading speed, performance, or other variables, everything depends on the performance of your website. If you keep the themes and plugins of your website updated, it improves the performance of your website.If you keep your website updated with cutting-edge technologies and modern trends, visitors will never question the quality of services you offer. In case, your website doesn’t have a professional standard, it fails to match the customer’s expectations thrilled with the content.Apart from this, if you review your website periodically, it helps you keep your website development techniques with the modern trends. It makes visitors thrilled and they get a reliable reason to trust your website.\n\nConclusion\n\nThough website maintenance is crucial for every business, still the majority of entrepreneurs ignore it. After going through the above discussion, you may now have a clear idea about Why regular website maintenance is crucial for business. So, all you need to do is to get in touch with a reputed website maintenance service provider.', '{\"v\":1,\"rows\":[{\"cols\":[{\"widgets\":[{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Introduction\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Irrespective of the size of your website, you need to opt for website maintenance and support. Your website represents your business across the world and also helps your customers gather information and buy your products.But, if your website is not working properly, your customers will not be able to go through your products and services. As a result, it makes an adverse impact on the growth of your business with less conversion, sales, and ROI.A flawless website is necessary for those in many real-time service industries. In today’s time, almost every business needs a website maintenance service whether they are from healthcare, automobile, eCommerce, Information Technology, or others.Hiring professional website maintenance company in India helps businesses in tantalizing the sense of new customers, help retain existing customers, improve SEO, and lots more.We will discuss everything related to why regular website maintenance is important. But, before this, it’s time to take a look at various statistics related to website maintenance services.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>1. 68% of websites fail to have a proper recovery plan<br>2. 87% of websites face medium or higher cyber security risks<br>3. 73.2% of websites use outdated software that makes them prone to security threats</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"<strong>Related Links:</strong>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><strong><a href=\\\"https://www.sunsys.in/the-website-maintenance-checklist-complete-guide\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">The Website Maintenance Checklist – Complete Guide</a></strong></p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Reasons Why Regular Website Maintenance is Important for Business\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>We are going to discuss here some of the top reasons why regular website maintenance tasks is crucial for any business. It gives you an idea of the importance of regular website maintenance.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"1. Update Content Regularly\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Several factors determine the quality of your website – content is one of those. It not only improves the quality of your website but also makes it informative and thus encourages users to engage with it. But, the outdated content will not make your website successful in drawing the attention of users. A regular content update keeps your website fresh and updated for your end users.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>A regular content update is also necessary for making your website interesting and also improves its position in search engines. With proper maintenance of your website, you can easily fine-tune content. It’s crucial to analyze phrases, keywords, etc, to get a chance to grab the attention of your website’s visitors. And it can generate higher leads and also can boost your conversion rates.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"2. Get Working Backup\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Once you have a regular website maintenance plan to keep your website up to date, it enables you to get a reliable backup if an emergency gets crashed. A working backup helps you deal with any situation by developing your website from scratch.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Once you hire a professional website maintenance company, they will be responsible for implementing various website elements that include source code including PHP, CSS, HTML, CSS, etc.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"3. Protection and Security\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Security of your website is something that is of great importance as it prevents your website from hackers. When you hire a reputed website maintenance service provider, they will be responsible for performing periodical maintenance. Therefore, professionals can easily identify bugs on your website and then fix them to avert any attacks.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>A website maintenance service provider can update your website’s software with the latest version and can also install any available security patches. It also helps you eliminate any kind of security threat that your website can get.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Apart from this, a web maintenance strategy is something that also includes the use of fully secure and strong passwords, and removing updated apps. Professional website maintenance service providers ensure the availability of sensitive files on your website.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"4. Compatibility with Innovative Technologies\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>It’s another reason why you need to opt for regular web maintenance services. With the growing internet world, new technologies and techniques are frequently introduced for improving user experience.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Therefore, any organization with an online presence must analyze regularly while reviewing the compatibility of its website with cutting-edge technologies. For instance, if your website is not mobile-friendly, then there’s a higher possibility that users will face problems accessing your device through mobiles.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>So, your regular website maintenance service provider must analyze your website by leveraging various internet technologies and techniques. It helps you know whether your website is fully compatible with the latest technologies or not.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"5. Launch of New Products and Services\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Your company often launches new products and services or introduces existing products with new features in the market. In this case, you must make a list of all those products online through your website. It’s one of the ways that a company uses to stay in this competitive market.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>So, you need to have a professional regular website maintenance service provider who gives you surety that your website will never be outdated.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"6. Boost User Experience\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>A professional and effective regular website maintenance plan is necessary for higher lead generation and also enhanced conversion rates. Your website must be capable of matching the expectation of your visitors. If your website functions poorly, it makes an adverse impact on your brand image. As a result, your customers will avoid visiting your website.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>So, all you need to do is to hire a top-rated regular website maintenance company that assists you in dealing with various technical issues that your website faces. Be it poor grammar, broken links, spelling errors, page loading errors, or other issues, website maintenance professionals can do everything to keep your website fully functional.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"7. Analyzing and Tracking\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>It’s vital to check various important metrics of websites that give you a complete insight into the complete progress of your campaigns. So, you can easily decide on the next plans or strategy for implementation.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>If you observe that your website is not capable of fulfilling your sales goals, it reflects that you should revamp your website with new strategies. It helps you match the sales target.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"8. Make Compatible with the Advanced Tools and Algorithms\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Another great advantage of having a top-rated website maintenance service for your business is it ensures compatibility of your website with the latest tools and algorithms. When it comes to search engines, these generally rate your websites quickly and make them fully maintained, error-free, and updated.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Therefore, if you update your website with fresh content, it can easily rank in search engines and will appear on the first page in SERP. To optimize your search engine optimization ranking, you should have an adequate regular website maintenance strategy. It helps your website adjust according to the dynamic search engine algorithms.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"9. Brand Image Promotion\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Your brand image plays an indispensable role in increasing the market reputation of your organization. And thus, it ensures the success of your business. Be its loading speed, performance, or other variables, everything depends on the performance of your website. If you keep the themes and plugins of your website updated, it improves the performance of your website.If you keep your website updated with cutting-edge technologies and modern trends, visitors will never question the quality of services you offer. In case, your website doesn’t have a professional standard, it fails to match the customer’s expectations thrilled with the content.Apart from this, if you review your website periodically, it helps you keep your website development techniques with the modern trends. It makes visitors thrilled and they get a reliable reason to trust your website.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Conclusion\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Though website maintenance is crucial for every business, still the majority of entrepreneurs ignore it. After going through the above discussion, you may now have a clear idea about Why regular website maintenance is crucial for business. So, all you need to do is to get in touch with a reputed website maintenance service provider.</p>\"}]}]}]}', 'Why Regular Website Maintenance Is Important', 'Regular website maintenance is important for the business which needs an content updates , Media Updates or event related tasks and many more. let us know more about this', '/uploads/blog/202410-dce9c7341c958748.webp', (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'website-maintenance'), 'published', '2024-10-16 03:12:36', '2024-10-16 03:12:36', '2025-03-03 04:08:49');
INSERT IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, body, blocks, meta_title, meta_description, cover, category_id, status, published_at, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('the-website-maintenance-checklist-complete-guide', 'The Website Maintenance Checklist – Complete Guide', 'When it comes to website maintenance, it is something that you can’t ignore if you have a website. It is necessary to maintain the higher performance of your website, which is necessary to increase s…', 'Introduction\n\nWhen it comes to website maintenance, it is something that you can’t ignore if you have a website. It is necessary to maintain the higher performance of your website, which is necessary to increase sales, conversion, and ROI.\n\nWhether you have developed a new website or have an existing website, you simply can’t ignore the importance of website maintenance.No matter which industry your business belongs to, opting for website maintenance services is necessary to keep your business growing.\n\nWhether you are from healthcare, hospitalization, Information technology, or education, a website maintenance company keeps your website updated with the latest innovation and improves its performance to a wider extent.A website maintenance service is fully responsible for analyzing your website, figuring out issues, and then making the right strategy to resolve this. They understand the importance of keeping your website updated and making it high performing.\n\nBefore we discuss the complete website maintenance checklist or keeping your website healthy and secure, it’s important to discuss various important things.Take a look at stats that make website maintenance services necessary for your website.\n\n1. 77% of websites load more than 10s\n2. 1 s delays can minimize your conversion rate by up to 20%\n3. 53% of visitors will not stay on your website if it takes more than 3s.\n\nRelated Links:\n\nWhy regular website maintenance is important\n\nWhy is Website Maintenance Crucial?\n\nYou need to understand that owning a website is something that like having a vehicle that needs a maintenance service. Website maintenance should be important task in your work list because , The size of your business is the best thing to determine what type of website maintenance service you need, be it daily, weekly, or monthly maintenance services.\n\nIn absence of good website maintenance services, your website will lose performance day by day. As a result, your business will be behind your competitors. Of course, having a well-structured website helps your business get the added advantage.\n\nBut, it’s also true that having just a website is certainly not enough. Routine maintenance of your website gives it the capability of running smoothly while delivering a wonderful performance. Take a look at some of the vital reasons why your business website needs maintenance and support services.\n\nAdvantages of Website Maintenance Checklist\n\n1. It Boosts Security\n\nSecurity is one of the crucial factors that are vital for the success of your website and thus for your business. If your website is developed on WordPress or Drupal, you still need to boost the security of your website.\n\nA fully secure website gives you a kind of guarantee that it’s free from any security threat and can’t be hacked. On the other hand, a website with a poor security system encourages hackers to perform illegal practices to steal your valuable data.\n\n2. Get SEO Advantages\n\nToday, everyone wants to rank their website in search engines. But, it’s certainly not possible for everyone to make their website stay on top of search results and grab users’ attention.\n\nMeanwhile, the most crucial thing about website maintenance and support companies is that they help your website rank in search engines. Website maintenance experts help your rank in search engines with impeccable strategy.\n\n3. Get Scheduled Backup\n\nScheduled backup is highly important for any website. It helps you deal with any situation easily. For instance, if your website gets hacked, you can use your backup to retrieve it and ensure it functions properly. Though you have a standard backup solution, you will still face a risk in terms of your server being hacked. There’s indeed a higher possibility that your website will be hacked by unwanted users.\n\n4. Boost Brand Reputation\n\nBrand reputation is one of those factors that determine the success of your business. In case, your website malfunctions or is slow, how does it impact your customers? It indeed makes an adverse impact on the reputation of your website. As a result, it impacts the overall results of your business.\n\nYou need to understand that even if your website is down for 1 second, it costs your business heavily. And your business may experience a heavy financial loss. A website maintenance service provider is responsible for monitoring your website 24/7 by ensuring higher uptime, performance, security, etc.\n\nTypes of Website Maintenance Checklists and Services\n\nHere, we are going to outline some of the website maintenance checklist that you can expect from a professional. It also gives you an idea in terms of how to maintain a website. let us go through the website Maintenance guide.\n\n1. Weekly Website Maintenance Checklist\n\nHere, we are going to outline some of the website maintenance checklist that you can expect from a professional. It also gives you an idea in terms of how to maintain a website. let us go through the website Maintenance guide.\n\n2. Analyze your Website Metrics\n\nYour website records a large amount of data, which includes tracking the way visitors behave. Besides, it also gives you complete details that include the best traffic sources, and also the content that boosts conversion. Professionals analyze your metrics to identify the issues and resolve them immediately.\n\n3. Update Plugins and Themes\n\nAs per research, outdated plugins or themes are the major reason for the growing case of hacking of WordPress websites. So, it’s necessary to update plugins and themes from time to time to keep your website updated and make your website fully protected from hackers. Updating your website with new plugins helps you add various new security features.\n\n4. Moderate Comments\n\nIt is one of the website maintenance tasks that professionals often do. The comment section serves its ultimate purpose to encourage visitors to read and engage with your website and content. Meanwhile, the comment section also has a certain dark side. Apart from this, the comment section also has various disadvantages.\n\nYou need to keep in mind that attackers often try to publish malicious content through spam content. If you make these comments live on your website, it makes a bad impression. It tends to be a discouraging factor for users to visit your website.\n\n5. Malware Scanning\n\nIf we talk about some of the secured website development platforms, WordPress comes first. WordPress has a great reputation for being fully secured. But, it’s also true that no software is 100% perfect. So, if you wish to keep your website high performing, it’s necessary for checking malware.\n\n6. Backup your Website\n\nIt’s necessary to create a regular backup of your website. Failing to do so may prevent you from restoring your recent works. It’s possible to create backups manually. Apart from your website maintenance company, you can also expect this from some hosting providers.\n\nMonthly Website Maintenance Checklist\n\n1. Update Content\n\nYou need to publish new content on your website regularly to keep it updated. It’s the most trusted method that ensures the conversion of your targeted visitors into repeat customers. A regular update of content on your website portrays you as a reliable brand and thus puts your experts on your horizon.\n\n2. Conduct Website Speed Testing\n\nThe loading speed of your website matters a lot and thus has a great impact on the success of your website. As per research, overall 40% of visitors avoid visiting your website if they find a slow loading speed. Apart from this, a slow loading speed of your website also tends to make your SEO effort futile.\n\n3. Enhance your Website’s SEO\n\nSearch engine optimization is another maintenance task for your website that you certainly can’t ignore at any cost. You may already have identified keyword popularity for your website. But, you should also be aware of the fact that keyword popularity tends to change over time.\n\nQuarterly Website Maintenance Checklist\n\n1. Identify and Remove Broken Links\n\nBroken links make an adverse impact on the search engine ranking of your website. And it’s also the fact that there are numerous reasons for broken links – deleting a page is one of those. Broken links also have a disastrous impact on the user experience of your website.\n\nA professional website maintenance company leverages tools like Semrush and others to scan broken links and fix them immediately.\n\n2. Change Password\n\nYour website should have a strong password to prevent anyone from easily unlocking it. One needs to implement the right practices that include two-factor authentication while creating a password. Even after the implementation of the latest practices for password changes, you need to change passwords quarterly to prevent your website from unauthorized access.\n\n3. Inspect Social Media Link\n\nMany businesses nowadays leverage the power of social media platforms such as Facebook, Twitter, Instagram, and others to make their presence among their targeted customers. It helps them improve their brand recognition, leads, and conversion rate.\n\nSo, if you target social media platforms, then your website must have the related buttons for content sharing. These links sometimes don’t work especially with any technological update by the social media platforms.\n\nSo, a website maintenance company analyzes the social media links of your website to ensure it works properly.\n\n4. Check Forms\n\nIt’s another crucial task that quarterly website maintenance includes. It’s vital to check whether forms work properly or not otherwise it will hurt the conversion rate of your website.\n\n5. Database Optimization\n\nBy optimizing the database properly, you will be able to minimize the load of your server. Besides, it also improves the page loading times of your website. DreamHost and phpMyAdmin are the right tools to optimize databases.\n\n6. Analyze Checkout Process\n\nFor an eCommerce website, the checkout process is something that is its core functionality since it helps businesses accept payment. If any issue persists with the checkout process of your website, it tends to create the worst scenario for your business.\n\nThanks to website maintenance services that also include analyzing the checkout process to ensure it functions smoothly.\n\n7. Remove Unnecessary Themes and Plugins\n\nIt’s vital to check all themes and plugins that your website uses. You need to identify those plugins and themes that you no longer require. Once you discover, you need to delete those to ensure the smooth function of your website.\n\nAnnual Website Maintenance Checklist\n\n1. Analyze Domain and Hosting Renewals\n\nYou need to be aware of the domain renewal schedule of your website. Failing to do so may lead you to pay a heavy cost for the same. A professional website maintenance service provider helps you in this.\n\n2. Analyze the ‘About’ Page\n\nYour website needs to have an eye-catching page as it convinces your customers about what you are doing, your offerings, and also much other essential information related to your business. An annual website maintenance plan includes it. Professionals review your page and ensure it works properly.\n\n3. Fix Schedule for User Testing\n\nUser testing is something that determines whether your website delivers a great UX. It defines the way users interact with your website. A professional company offers annual usability testing to ensure whether your website delivers a wonderful user experience or not.\n\n4. Update Legal Policies, Footer, Heading\n\nWhen it comes to header and footer, these are important elements of your website. These have a pivotal role when it comes to putting your website page at your users’ fingertips. You can get the help of website maintenance experts to remove those links that are no longer required. You will find your website contains content that deserves to be on top.\n\n5. Content Audit\n\nA content audit is another vital part that your annual website maintenance plan includes. You need to publish relevantly and also quite engaging content that ensures your website is fully active. And it also portrays you as an expert in this field. This content plays a crucial role in increasing search engine rankings.\n\nTo get the best result, you need to perform an annual content audit. A professional website maintenance service provider evaluates whether the content that your website includes performs well or not. It helps you identify topics and formats that tempt the most significant traffic and propel your conversion rate.\n\nConclusion\n\nDo you think your website works properly and delivers performance as per your expectations? If not, then opting for website maintenance and support services can be the right option for you. Above are some of the advantages that you can avail of after hiring the best professional. Hope this Website maintenance guide help you to analyze your website updates.', '{\"v\":1,\"rows\":[{\"cols\":[{\"widgets\":[{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Introduction\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>When it comes to website maintenance, it is something that you can’t ignore if you have a website. It is necessary to maintain the higher performance of your website, which is necessary to increase sales, conversion, and ROI.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Whether you have developed a new website or have an existing website, you simply can’t ignore the importance of website maintenance.No matter which industry your business belongs to, opting for website maintenance services is necessary to keep your business growing.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Whether you are from healthcare, hospitalization, Information technology, or education, a website maintenance company keeps your website updated with the latest innovation and improves its performance to a wider extent.A <a href=\\\"https://www.sunsys.in/website-maintenance-company-bangalore/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">website maintenance service</a> is fully responsible for analyzing your website, figuring out issues, and then making the right strategy to resolve this. They understand the importance of keeping your website updated and making it high performing.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Before we discuss the complete website maintenance checklist or keeping your website healthy and secure, it’s important to discuss various important things.Take a look at stats that make website maintenance services necessary for your website.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>1. 77% of websites load more than 10s<br>2. 1 s delays can minimize your conversion rate by up to 20%<br>3. 53% of visitors will not stay on your website if it takes more than 3s.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"<strong>Related Links:</strong>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><strong><a href=\\\"https://www.sunsys.in/why-regular-website-maintenance-is-important\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Why regular website maintenance is important</a></strong></p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Why is Website Maintenance Crucial?\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>You need to understand that owning a website is something that like having a vehicle that needs a maintenance service. Website maintenance should be important task in your work list because , The size o