ther forms work properly or not otherwise it will hurt the conversion rate of your website.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"5. Database Optimization\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>By optimizing the database properly, you will be able to minimize the load of your server. Besides, it also improves the page loading times of your website. DreamHost and phpMyAdmin are the right tools to optimize databases.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"6. Analyze Checkout Process\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>For an eCommerce website, the checkout process is something that is its core functionality since it helps businesses accept payment. If any issue persists with the checkout process of your website, it tends to create the worst scenario for your business.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Thanks to website maintenance services that also include analyzing the checkout process to ensure it functions smoothly.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"7. Remove Unnecessary Themes and Plugins\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>It’s vital to check all themes and plugins that your website uses. You need to identify those plugins and themes that you no longer require. Once you discover, you need to delete those to ensure the smooth function of your website.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Annual Website Maintenance Checklist\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"1. Analyze Domain and Hosting Renewals\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>You need to be aware of the domain renewal schedule of your website. Failing to do so may lead you to pay a heavy cost for the same. A professional website maintenance service provider helps you in this.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"2. Analyze the ‘About’ Page\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Your website needs to have an eye-catching page as it convinces your customers about what you are doing, your offerings, and also much other essential information related to your business. An annual website maintenance plan includes it. Professionals review your page and ensure it works properly.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"3. Fix Schedule for User Testing\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>User testing is something that determines whether your website delivers a great UX. It defines the way users interact with your website. A professional company offers annual usability testing to ensure whether your website delivers a wonderful user experience or not.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"4. Update Legal Policies, Footer, Heading\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>When it comes to header and footer, these are important elements of your website. These have a pivotal role when it comes to putting your website page at your users’ fingertips. You can get the help of website maintenance experts to remove those links that are no longer required. You will find your website contains content that deserves to be on top.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"5. Content Audit\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>A content audit is another vital part that your annual website maintenance plan includes. You need to publish relevantly and also quite engaging content that ensures your website is fully active. And it also portrays you as an expert in this field. This content plays a crucial role in increasing search engine rankings.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>To get the best result, you need to perform an annual content audit. A professional website maintenance service provider evaluates whether the content that your website includes performs well or not. It helps you identify topics and formats that tempt the most significant traffic and propel your conversion rate.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Conclusion\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Do you think your website works properly 