INSERT IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, body, blocks, meta_title, meta_description, cover, category_id, status, published_at, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('what-is-website-maintenance-and-why-it-is-important', 'What Is Website Maintenance And Why It is Important?', 'Even if you have developed a business-friendly website still your website will fail to deliver the best performance. As a result, your business will suffer a lot. It happens generally with time, espe…', 'Overview\n\nEven if you have developed a business-friendly website still your website will fail to deliver the best performance. As a result, your business will suffer a lot. It happens generally with time, especially with the change in customer behavior and also the launch of various new trends.\n\nSo, all you need to do is to keep your website up to date with the latest trends and maintain consistency in its performance. You should go for website maintenance services that will keep your website updated with improved engagement, conversion rate, and ROI..\n\nRelated Links:\n\nHow Website Maintenance Helps Small Business To Grow Digitally\n\nWhat is website maintenance?\n\nAs the name suggests, website maintenance is an important practice to analyze the overall condition of your website. The process involves thorough monitoring of your website to know the issues that cause its deteriorated performance.\n\nAs mentioned above, website maintenance includes various techniques to keep your website versed and updated to make it relevant to changing market trends, the emergence of new technologies, etc. It not only helps your website catch the attention of new visitors but is also crucial to retain even those of existing visitors as well\n\n1. Importance of Website Maintenance\n\nWell, going through the following stats will let you know the importance of website maintenance and also why you need to opt for an agency that possesses vast experience in this. Take a look.\n\n1. 87% of overall websites face a higher risk of cyber security risk. These websites are the prime target of hackers.\n2. 77% of websites fail to load within 1 to 2 seconds. It prevents them from getting higher user engagement.\n3. 68% of websites fail to have a proper data recovery plan.\n4. 73% of websites use outdated software that could be a bigger security threat.\n5. According to 93% of people, online reviews play a vital role in decision-making for website users.\n\n2. Advantages of Website Maintenance\n\nWe will figure out some of the significant advantages of opting for maintenance services. Go through them one by one to grasp them in-depth.\n\n3. \nUpdate Content\n\nYour website needs to have fresh and informative content to keep users engaged. It is necessary to encourage your website visitors to come back. Updating content on your website regularly makes it more appealing and also helps it appear in search results.\n\nThe ongoing website maintenance updates content on your website. They regularly analyze the content of every page and replace the old content with the new one.\n\n4. Get Working Backup\n\nOnce you have a fixed schedule for period website maintenance, it helps you get a fully reliable backup. In case, your website gets crashes or some other related issues take place, you can use this working backup to deal with the situation. With working backup, you will find it quite easy to recover.\n\n5. Improve Security\n\nYour website is incomplete without high-grade security features. So, this is another factor why you need to have ongoing maintenance support for your website. Your website maintenance service provider implements the latest security features to make your website fully secure. And they prevent your website from various potential security threats be it malicious software or hackers. With ongoing support, you can prevent your website from various security patches and thus make it secure for your potential customers to visit.\n\n6. Boost User Experience\n\nUser experience is another reason why website maintenance is crucial. It plays a crucial role in ensuring the success of your website. Many studies already proved the fact that visitors who access those websites that have a slow loading speed don’t spend too much time on them. A periodic maintenance service provider optimizes images, videos, etc, of your website to improve its loading speed.\n\n7. Boost Website Traffic\n\nIncreasing website traffic is the ultimate aim of every business owner to discover more potential customers, and increase sales, and revenue. Website maintenance helps you a lot in this. A service provider does various activities including content improvement to boost the search engine ranking of your website. And it delivers a wonderful outcome by enhancing its search engine ranking.\n\n8. Cost of Website Maintenance\n\nWell, after going through the above benefits of website maintenance services, you might be keen to hire a professional website maintenance service company. If yes, then cost would be the first thing that you might be thinking about, right?You should know that the cost of website maintenance is not fixed for every website. It varies based on the type, size, etc. of your website. However, an average website maintenance cost ranges from $500/month to $6000/year.We will analyze here the cost of website maintenance based on the type of website.\n\nType of Website\n\nFor Basic Website\nProfessional Blog\nSmall Business\nLarge Business\neCommerce Website\n\nCost\n\n$5 to $30/month\n$30 to $70/month\n$50 to $200/month\n$200 to $5000/month\n$2000 to $6000/month\n\nWhat does a Website Maintenance Plan Include?\n\nTake a look at some vital website maintenance plan that every service provider considers for making your website high-performing and result-driven.\n\nAdvantages of Website Maintenance\n\n1. Finding Broken Pages\n\nIt’s one of the most crucial aspects of website maintenance. One needs to spend enough time finding broken links for websites. It not only makes it tough to navigate your website but also makes an adverse impact on the online visibility of your site and thus sales. So, check the broken link at least once a month.\n\n2. Find Out Broken Images\n\nBroken images, another important website maintenance checklist, are other things that you should look for to keep your website up to date. A website with distorted images always looks outdated and thus poorly maintained. Besides, it can spoil the conversion rate of your website as well.You can check broken images manually, especially if you have a large website, and replace the same with quality images.\n\n3. Check for Broken Links\n\nNo matter how much effort you put to do search engine optimization of your website, you can’t improve its rank with broken links. You can use a third-party crawler that will help you find all those broken links that your website contains.\n\n4. Do Regular Update\n\nMake sure all software that your website is integrated with is updated properly. Well, you will come across various software that gets updated automatically or helps you know when the update is available. All you need to do is check their update manually on a monthly basis.\n\nConclusion\n\nWebsite maintenance is essential to keep the consistency of the best performance of your website maintained for a long time. Besides, it also makes your website engaging. So, find website maintenance experts that deliver mind-blowing services.', '{\"v\":1,\"rows\":[{\"cols\":[{\"widgets\":[{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Overview\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Even if you have developed a business-friendly website still your website will fail to deliver the best performance. As a result, your business will suffer a lot. It happens generally with time, especially with the change in customer behavior and also the launch of various new trends.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>So, all you need to do is to keep your website up to date with the latest trends and maintain consistency in its performance. You should go for website maintenance services that will keep your website updated with improved engagement, conversion rate, and ROI..</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"<strong>Related Links:</strong>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><strong><a href=\\\"https://www.sunsys.in/how-website-maintenance-helps-small-business-to-grow-digitally\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">How Website Maintenance Helps Small Business To Grow Digitally</a></strong></p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"What is website maintenance?\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>As the name suggests, website maintenance is an important practice to analyze the overall condition of your website. The process involves thorough monitoring of your website to know the issues that cause its deteriorated performance.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>As mentioned above, website maintenance includes various techniques to keep your website versed and updated to make it relevant to changing market trends, the emergence of new technologies, etc. It not only helps your website catch the attention of new visitors but is also crucial to retain even those of existing visitors as well</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"1. Importance of Website Maintenance\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Well, going through the following stats will let you know the importance of website maintenance and also why you need to opt for an agency that possesses vast experience in this. Take a look.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>1. 87% of overall websites face a higher risk of cyber security risk. These websites are the prime target of hackers.<br>2. 77% of websites fail to load within 1 to 2 seconds. It prevents them from getting higher user engagement.<br>3. 68% of websites fail to have a proper data recovery plan.<br>4. 73% of websites use outdated software that could be a bigger security threat.<br>5. According to 93% of people, online reviews play a vital role in decision-making for website users.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"2. Advantages of Website Maintenance\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>We will figure out some of the significant advantages of opting for maintenance services. Go through them one by one to grasp them in-depth.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"3. \\nUpdate Content\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Your website needs to have fresh and informative content to keep users engaged. It is necessary to encourage your website visitors to come back. Updating content on your website regularly makes it more appealing and also helps it appear in search results.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>The ongoing website maintenance updates content on your website. They regularly analyze the content of every page and replace the old content with the new one.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"4. Get Working Backup\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Once you have a fixed schedule for period website maintenance, it helps you get a fully reliable backup. In case, your website gets crashes or some other related issues take place, you can use this working backup to deal with the situation. With working backup, you will find it quite easy to recover.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"5. Improve Security\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Your website is incomplete without high-grade security features. So, this is another factor why you need to have ongoing maintenance support for your website. Your website maintenance service provider implements the latest security features to make your website fully secure. And they prevent your website from various potential security threats be it malicious software or hackers. With ongoing support, you can prevent your website from various security patches and thus make it secure for your potential customers to visit.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"6. Boost User Experience\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>User experience is another reason why website maintenance is crucial. It plays a crucial role in ensuring the success of your website. Many studies already proved the fact that visitors who access those websites that have a slow loading speed don’t spend too much time on them. A periodic maintenance service provider optimizes images, videos, etc, of your website to improve its loading speed.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"7. Boost Website Traffic\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Increasing website traffic is the ultimate aim of every business owner to discover more potential customers, and increase sales, and revenue. Website maintenance helps you a lot in this. A service provider does various activities including content improvement to boost the search engine ranking of your website. And it delivers a wonderful outcome by enhancing its search engine ranking.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"8. Cost of Website Maintenance\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Well, after going through the above benefits of website maintenance services, you might be keen to hire a professional website maintenance service company. If yes, then cost would be the first thing that you might be thinking about, right?You should know that the cost of website maintenance is not fixed for every website. It varies based on the type, size, etc. of your website. However, an average website maintenance cost ranges from $500/month to $6000/year.We will analyze here the cost of website maintenance based on the type of website.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><strong>Type of Website</strong></p>\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":true,\"items\":[\"For Basic Website\",\"Professional Blog\",\"Small Business\",\"Large Business\",\"eCommerce Website\"]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><strong>Cost</strong></p>\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":true,\"items\":[\"$5 to $30/month\",\"$30 to $70/month\",\"$50 to $200/month\",\"$200 to $5000/month\",\"$2000 to $6000/month\"]},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"What does a Website Maintenance Plan Include?\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Take a look at some vital website maintenance plan that every service provider considers for making your website high-performing and result-driven.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Advantages of Website Maintenance\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"1. Finding Broken Pages\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>It’s one of the most crucial aspects of website maintenance. One needs to spend enough time finding broken links for websites. It not only makes it tough to navigate your website but also makes an adverse impact on the online visibility of your site and thus sales. So, check the broken link at least once a month.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"2. Find Out Broken Images\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Broken images, another important <a href=\\\"https://www.sunsys.in/the-website-maintenance-checklist-complete-guide\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">website maintenance checklist</a>, are other things that you should look for to keep your website up to date. A website with distorted images always looks outdated and thus poorly maintained. Besides, it can spoil the conversion rate of your website as well.You can check broken images manually, especially if you have a large website, and replace the same with quality images.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"3. Check for Broken Links\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>No matter how much effort you put to do search engine optimization of your website, you can’t improve its rank with broken links. You can use a third-party crawler that will help you find all those broken links that your website contains.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"4. Do Regular Update\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Make sure all software that your website is integrated with is updated properly. Well, you will come across various software that gets updated automatically or helps you know when the update is available. All you need to do is check their update manually on a monthly basis.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Conclusion\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Website maintenance is essential to keep the consistency of the best performance of your website maintained for a long time. Besides, it also makes your website engaging. So, find website maintenance experts that deliver mind-blowing services.</p>\"}]}]}]}', 'What is Website Maintenance And Its Importance', 'In this blog let us know about what is website maintenance and why web maintenance is important for business.', '/uploads/blog/202410-3f8ed8e4433cd55f.webp', (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'website-maintenance'), 'published', '2024-10-16 03:20:22', '2024-10-16 03:20:22', '2025-07-09 16:40:41');
INSERT IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, body, blocks, meta_title, meta_description, cover, category_id, status, published_at, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('how-website-maintenance-helps-small-business-to-grow-digitally', 'How Website Maintenance Helps Small Business To Grow Digitally', 'In today’s digital landscape, a website serves as a great tool for businesses for marketing their products. Businesses can serve customers online through their website, apart from enjoying a robust o…', 'Overview\n\nIn today’s digital landscape, a website serves as a great tool for businesses for marketing their products. Businesses can serve customers online through their website, apart from enjoying a robust online presence which is essential for brand building. But, these can be possible only if your website functions properly. Here are some of the advantages of website maintenance for small business listed.\n\nNo matter how good a website you already developed for your business, it will fail to deliver better performance after the passage of time.\n\nSo, to tackle the same, you need to go for website maintenance that helps your website continue to deliver higher performance and thus helps your business to stay ahead of competitors.\n\nBefore we move ahead to discuss the how website maintenance helps Small Business, it’s time to dive into the basics.\n\nWhat is website maintenance?\n\nWell, you would be curious to know the basics of website maintenance, right? Well, as the name suggests, website maintenance is an important process that involves checking issues on your website on a regular basis and resolving them.\n\nProfessionals maintain consistency in their task of website maintenance to make the health of your website better. It helps your website generate higher traffic, increase conversion, Google ranking, and more.\n\nNo matter what type of business you run, keeping your website fully maintained and updated is your prime task.\n\nRelated Links:\n\nWhat Is Website Maintenance And Why It is Important?\n\nAdvantages of website maintenance for small business\n\nWell, small businesses can harness the following benefits of website maintenance to stay ahead of competitors and thus compete online.\n\n1. Maintenance of Website Security\n\nIt’s one of the Importance of web maintenance for small businesses. If your website is compromised with security or has an outdated security feature, it can put your business at high risk. It could be a prime target of hackers.\n\nA website with cutting-edge security features, on the other hand, improves your brand reputation by portraying you as a reliable brand. It thus improves your relationship with customers.\n\nOne of the advantages of website maintenance for small businesses is that it lets you come across all security issues that your website has. And your website maintenance service provider can quickly resolve it.\n\n2. Tackle Unexpected Happenings\n\nIn the IT world, anything can happen suddenly and can ruin your business in seconds. Your website tends to face several issues every time with every new update.\n\nIn certain situations, things could go worse and there may be a situation when your website stops working.\n\nThis can be even worse for those who don’t have much experience in tackling websites. Dealing with such a situation can be highly stressful and also time-consuming if you are a busy entrepreneur.\n\nAnd if your website stops working even for a second, it could have an adverse impact on the online reputation of your business.\n\nWhen you opt for website maintenance services, they are always ready to take care of your website regardless of the situation. These professionals are aware of unexpected happenings and make their preparation accordingly to tackle the situation in a better way.\n\n3. Constant Update of Content\n\nYou need to update your website with informative and meaningful content constantly to gain the attention of users.\n\nIt helps your website get constant customer engagement, which helps you discover more potential customers for your business. As a result, you can maintain a constant robust online presence of your brand and grab various opportunities to grow your business.\n\nThe best thing about hiring a website maintenance company is that they take care of your need of updating your website with relevant content.\n\nThey keep your website content fresh and more informative based on the queries of your target customers. It helps in increasing customer loyalty, brand awareness, etc.\n\n4. Stay Ahead of Competition\n\nA professional website maintenance company always leverages cutting-edge tools to gather relevant data and update your website accordingly. It’s one of the top benefits of website maintenance. They gather data related to your customers’ behavior.\n\nWith this data, these professionals get an idea about what works the best for your website in terms of what visitors prefer the most. And they focus on those items that work best and do necessary updates for your website accordingly.\n\nIn this way, regular and constant updates of your business website are a better way to outrank competitors easily. Once your website ranks well in search engines, it not only improves the ranking of the website but also helps it stand out from the competition.\n\n5. Acquire New Customers with Improved Retention\n\nAcquiring new customers constantly reflects that your business is progressive. Increasing customer retention, on the other hand, makes your business reliable and thus more customer-centric. An outdated website will not cater to your needs.\n\nThe major benefit of website maintenance is you find it quite easier to optimize the overall performance of your website. Professionals who are responsible for updating your website work with a thorough plan.\n\nThey work with a clear mechanism to analyze the speed of your website and thus, enable you to avoid any kind of issues related to the performance of your website.\n\nPartnering with a reliable website maintenance service provider is decisive as they possess a vast understanding of the relevance of monitoring, which is indeed necessary for optimal website performance.\n\nIt helps you offer a seamless and positive experience that helps you ensure your customers come back and that your website maintains consistency in terms of user engagement.\n\n6. Improve Brand Image\n\nRemember a website is the face of any business. It reflects much about businesses in terms of their philosophy and of course their offerings.\n\nMoreover, a fully-functionality and easy-to-use website impresses visitors a lot and makes them feel good while accessing it. And it also encourages them to visit again and again.\n\nOn the other hand, if your business has a poorly maintained website accompanied by broken links, various errors, dead pages, etc.\n\nIt’s certainly difficult for visitors to stay on your website for a longer time and you will find the deteriorated performance of your website that also impacts the growth of your business.\n\nThe main benefit of hiring a website maintenance company is they make a proper routine to analyze your website and also update the same when it comes to matching your corporate image.\n\nThey thoroughly check every issue be its poor grammar, broken links, or others. And fix the same immediately without any hindrance.\n\n7.  Improve SEO Ranking\n\nYour business finds it tough to compete online without ranking on top in search engines. If you don’t update your website on a regular basis, you will fail to rank your website in Google and other search engines.\n\nEven if your website already ranks, its ranking will fall without a proper update and maintenance of your website.\n\nMoreover, if your website’s content is not updated for a long time, it makes an adverse impact on search engine ranking. Google’s crawlers analyze the HTTP header of your website pages to decide whether crawling should be done.\n\nA website maintenance service provider keeps eyes on all pages of your website and replaces the old content with new one.\n\nConclusion\n\nSo, above are some of the advantages of website maintenance for small businesses. Simply having a website will not ensure the success of your business, no matter how good it is.\n\nYou need to constantly update your website with the latest trends and changing user behavior to help it stay relevant in the market. This is how website maintenance can helps small business with huge benefits.\n\nHire a reliable website maintenance service provider that promises to deliver a world-class service.', '{\"v\":1,\"rows\":[{\"cols\":[{\"widgets\":[{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Overview\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>In today’s digital landscape, a website serves as a great tool for businesses for marketing their products. Businesses can serve customers online through their website, apart from enjoying a robust online presence which is essential for brand building. But, these can be possible only if your website functions properly. Here are some of the advantages of website maintenance for small business listed.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>No matter how good a website you already developed for your business, it will fail to deliver better performance after the passage of time.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>So, to tackle the same, you need to go for website maintenance that helps your website continue to deliver higher performance and thus helps your business to stay ahead of competitors.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Before we move ahead to discuss the how website maintenance helps Small Business, it’s time to dive into the basics.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"What is website maintenance?\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Well, you would be curious to know the basics of website maintenance, right? Well, as the name suggests, website maintenance is an important process that involves checking issues on your website on a regular basis and resolving them.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Professionals maintain consistency in their task of website maintenance to make the health of your website better. It helps your website generate higher traffic, increase conversion, Google ranking, and more.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>No matter what type of business you run, keeping your website fully maintained and updated is your prime task.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"<strong>Related Links:</strong>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><strong><a href=\\\"https://www.sunsys.in/what-is-website-maintenance-and-why-it-is-important\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">What Is Website Maintenance And Why It is Important?</a></strong></p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Advantages of website maintenance for small business\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><em>Well, small businesses can harness the following benefits of website maintenance to stay ahead of competitors and thus compete online.</em></p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"1. Maintenance of Website Security\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>It’s one of the Importance of web maintenance for small businesses. If your website is compromised with security or has an outdated security feature, it can put your business at high risk. It could be a prime target of hackers.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>A website with cutting-edge security features, on the other hand, improves your brand reputation by portraying you as a reliable brand. It thus improves your relationship with customers.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>One of the advantages of website maintenance for small businesses is that it lets you come across all security issues that your website has. And your website maintenance service provider can quickly resolve it.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":