precisely setting aside the longest effort to stack on your website page. Essentially enter the URL of the page you’re hoping to assess and trust that the outcomes will come in. For example, the underneath test is for the landing page of magnificence store Sephora: more than 200 components make up this page, and by checking out the left section, you can see what is setting aside the longest effort to stack. For instance, while the pictures take under 50 milliseconds to stack, a Facebook module takes 182 ms. Figuring out how to peruse a site page test is very important: discover more in our investigation of the speed of 300+ Magento sites.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"2.  Guarantee Your Pictures Are Improved for Web\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Utilize a picture-altering apparatus, for example, Photoshop or a free picture re-sizer, to measure your pictures suitably, so you’re not causing clients to download huge documents.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>To do this, first, discover what the greatest permitted picture size is for your page or blog format, as a rule, it will not be more than 800px width, and regardless of whether you transfer bigger pictures, they will be estimated down. Then, the notion of web design has to be done accordingly.<br>Assuming you use HTML tags, for example, and a width or tallness detail, you’re not lessening the picture size on your server, just how it shows up on the page.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>When you decide on your ideal picture size, save as that size. Assuming you’re utilizing a picture manager, you can likewise save at 80% quality, decreasing the record size.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>You can choose choices that reduce the document size by your ideal rate (we don’t suggest saving over half more modest).</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>JPG and PNG are the best record types for the web. This is one of the best web page speed opimization tip.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"3.  Decrease The Number of Modules on Your Site\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Modules like Google Analytics give significant data; however, they can dial back page load time. These instruments typically work by entering a JavaScript bit someplace in your site code (usually in the header area).</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Clients need to gather this remote record before the page is completely stacked when the client visits your page.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Assuming that you have a few of these snippets, say one for Google Analytics, one for sharing on Facebook, and one for sharing on Twitter, your page will take more time to get done with stacking.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>So, check your HTML code routinely to ensure you need all the modules introduced on your page.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"4. Eliminate Superfluous Code in Your CSS Records\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Your CSS document needs to stack before your page becomes visible; however, if you (and others) have been expanding upon a similar record for quite a while, it probably has a ton of unnecessary code – each additional room or line will amount to a slower pace! This will greatly help in the notion of web development. Go through the code yourself on the off chance that any secret components aren’t being utilized, or utilize a free CSS minified, which will eliminate additional areas and code for you. Here are a few assets Google proposes for minifying HTML, CSS, and JavaScript code. This can increase website speed.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"5. Store Your Pages\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>You drastically decrease the number of solicitations to your server by storing your pages, accelerating page load time, and reserving assists likewise with the versatility of your site during top traffic times, for example, when you are running an email advertising effort or online business deal.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Conclusion\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>To sum up, the range of potential options that can be explored here is thus found to be huge. Here we explored only five factors that can improve the overall website speed optimization.In this regard, it must be mentioned here that there are many other such ways to ensure that the tactics work perfectly.Websites govern many aspects of our lives, and thus, timely action and choosing the Best website maintenance company are needed to ensure that speed is always up to the best possible mark.The potential for future uses shall be then found to be huge and has to be therefore noted with due concern as well as diligence to be seen in this case.</p>\"}]}]}]}', 'Top 5 Tips for Website Speed Optimization', 'Now a days Website Speed Optimization is most important for any website. If you you want to grow your business and get better ranking in SERP the you must optimize your website from lazy loading to high speed.', '/uploads/blog/202410-7715149a220ba2c5.webp', (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'website-maintenance'), 'published', '2024-10-16 03:28:54', '2024-10-16 03:28:54', '2025-02-28 04:39:34');
INSERT IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, body, blocks, meta_title, meta_description, cover, category_id, status, published_at, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('top-10-wordpress-seo-plugins-to-improve-website-performance', 'Top 10 WordPress SEO Plugins To Improve Website Performance', 'So, you have already built a WordPress website, spent a lot of time putting content, and finally launched it for your target audience. And you are waiting for your website to generate higher traffic,…', 'Overview\n\nSo, you have already built a WordPress website, spent a lot of time putting content, and finally launched it for your target audience. And you are waiting for your website to generate higher traffic, right? Well, your website will match your aim and expectation only if it’s SEO-friendly.\n\nWhen it comes to search engine optimization, it’s a well-tried and tested method of increasing organic traffic and making your website successful. It’s an ongoing process that involves numerous activities including on-page and off-page. You need to equally focus on both of these activities to achieve the desired results.\n\nMeanwhile, if you have already developed your website on WordPress, you should not worry about SEO. The actual reason is this platform includes numerous resources to make your effort easy.\n\nTo make fully optimization of your WordPress website, you need to just choose a top-quality WordPress theme that should be SEO-friendly. Apart from this, you should also install top 10 WordPress SEO plugins for website that help you implement the best strategy for search engine optimization perfectly.\n\nRelated Links:\n\nTop 10 Must-Have WordPress Plugins For Your Business\n\nTop 10 WordPress SEO Plugins\n\nNow let’s discuss some of the WordPress SEO plugins that you can consider installing to improve the search engine ranking of your website. Explore the complete list.\n\n1.  Yoast SEO\n\nWhile talking about some of the popular WordPress SEO plugins, it’s good to start with none other than Yoast SEO. It’s already a popular wordpress SEO plugin for a website developed on the WordPress platform and witnessed higher installation rates.\n\nThe reason for the extreme popularity of Yoast is it offers higher flexibility that enables you to deal with different types of content. Be its meta description, title, keyword, or description, you can check numerous things with the use of this plugin. A beginner can also use this plugin in a better way. Moreover, if you have enough knowledge, you can use its advanced menu.\n\nFeatures:\n\nCheck and improve paragraph structure\nPermalink cleanups\nSocial sharing\nCheck keyword density\nCheck meta description and link support\n\nPrice:\n\nBasic version is free and the premium version is available for $99.\n\n2. All-in-One SEO Pack Plugin\n\nIt’s another SEO plugin that you can use for your WordPress website. It’s quite the same as those of Yoast SEO. With this, you can easily optimize both your website and content for search engines most efficiently.\n\nThis plugin is available with various features like XML sitemap creation, keyword optimization, meta tag generation, and more.\n\nFeatures:\n\nSocial media integration\nSEO audit checklist\nSmart XML sitemaps\nVideo SEO sitemaps\nRich snippets schema\n\nPrice:\n\nThe premium version is available at $199.50/year.\n\n3. WP Meta SEO Plugin\n\nYou can go for another WordPress SEO plugin, which is WP Meta SEO to keep eye on the search engine optimization status of your site with the help of an information dashboard.\n\nThere’s indeed a simple and also quick process for its configuration, which makes it easy for users to work conveniently. The important benefit of this plugin is its SEO mass processing feature. It makes the entire process of content optimization quick by editing numerous pages at once.\n\nFeatures:\n\nBulk editing for website meta on a single view\nBulk editing for the SEO link title\nInternal broken link checker\n404 errors redirection\nBulk editing for meta and file name\n\nPrice:\n\n$49/year for the premium version\n\n4. SEOPress WordPress Plugin\n\nIf you are in search of a more robust SEO plugin for your WordPress website, you should set your eyes on none other than SEOPress. The most interesting thing about this plugin is that it’s simple to use.\n\nIt includes numerous features that one can expect in this type of tool, including titles, redirection, XML images, titles, descriptions, etc. Like the Yoast SEO, it’s also beginner-friendly and lets them avail of the most out of this plugin.\n\nFeatures:\n\nInstant indexing for both Google and Bing\nContent analysis\nPage builders integration\nGoogle Analytics\nBlock editor\n\nPrice:\n\n$49/year\n\n5. Broken Link Checker Plugin\n\nWhen it comes to a broken link checker, it’s known to always have a good impact on the actual performance of your website. You need to keep in mind that these broken links often confuse search engines to crawl your website and thus negatively impact the ranking of websites as well as their content.\n\nInstallation of this plugin helps you get rid of this kind of problem and lets you fix the problems most easily. With this plugin, you can fix all types of broken links be they external or internal.\n\nIrrespective of the size of your website, Broken Link Checker indeed works most effectively. It can check broken links for all pages of your website. Besides, it also checks the missing images.\n\nFeatures:\n\nScan broken links\nCheck the status of broken links\nRedirect link report\nEdit Post\nEdit broken links\n\nPrice:\n\nSite check is free and auto checker premium is available at $39.95/month or $440/yearly\n\n6. W3 Total Cache Plugin\n\nWell, if you notice a speed issue with your website, you need to go for installation of W3 Total Cache. This plugin serves its ultimate purpose of improving the speed of your website and thus making it more user-centric.\n\nWhen it comes to the setup of this plugin, you will find some kind of difficulty as well. But, its installation is indeed worthwhile for getting the desired outcomes. If your website gets a higher amount of traffic, this tool helps your website run smoothly.\n\nFeatures:\n\nProvide SSL support\nFully compatible with shared hosting, dedicated server, etc.\nAMP support\nTransparent CDN with theme files, media library, etc.\nEasy to set up\n\nPrice:\n\n$99/year pro license\n\n7. Premium SEO Pack\n\nIt’s another popular WordPress SEO plugin that is designed mainly to assist you with your website optimized for search engines. It’s available with a tool that enables you to make your website quick and also offers a complete and the most satisfactory experience to users.\n\nIt boosts the internal link-building of any website, which is indeed crucial from an SEO point of view. The tool also works well for the optimization of images on your website properly. This plugin is also available with a snippet feature, so you can highlight your post on search results along with a complete optimization feature on your blog page.\n\nFeatures:\n\nGood for website optimization for search engines\nIt includes 25+ modules\nSERP tracking\n404 monitor\nMinify Javascript and CSS\n\nPrice:\n\nN/A\n\n8. SEMrush SEO Writing Assistant\n\nThough it’s not the most frequently used plugin as other WordPress plugins, it’s also a good option for most website owners. If you wish to leverage this tool, you need to first create your account in SEMrush without paying anything. It will give you the direct access tone template. If you need more options, you need to go for the premium version.\n\nThis tool analyzes and reviews your content and then awards scores based on its criteria. Here, you can also view text suggestions that will help you improve your content for search engines. Apart from this, it also helps you add keywords, and based on your input, it provides you with lots of related keywords.\n\nFeatures:\n\nCheck SEO potential and originality of content\nSeamless integration with Google Doc\nIt offers both readability and SEO suggestions for your content\nCheck plagiarism\nCheck the tone of voice\n\nPrice:\n\nThe premium version starts at $119.95 and goes up to $449.95.\n\n9. Anti Spam Plugin\n\nYou may have noticed several times that people leave comments on your blog with some links to promote their products, blogs, or websites. These comments have the potential to make an adverse impact on the ranking of your website. So, you need to avoid those as much as possible.\n\nAll you need to do is install the Anti-Spam plugin that will make your task easy. It filters those spam comments and allows only those genuine ones.\n\nFeatures:\n\nEasy to install\nClear stats\nSpam protection for various websites at once even in different CMS\n24/7 technical support\nSave time and resources\n\nPrice:\n\nN/A\n\n10. ShortPixel Plugin\n\nAs the name suggests, ShortPixel is the right tool for those who wish to optimize images. The plugin has great potential to compress them even without loss of extracted EXIF data, and quality, and optimize it in a better way. You can install the plugin easily to test certain images to check if the quality is up to your satisfaction.\n\nFeatures:\n\nIt can optimize any type of image\nFull compatibility with WP Retina 2X\nOption for conversion PNG to JPG\nSmart cropping\nOptimize features and thumbnail images\n\nPrice:\n\nBasic version is available free of cost. The Premium version starts at $4.99 for 5,000 image credits.\n\nConclusion\n\nSo, after going through the above discussion, you may have enough idea about the above popular SEO plugins for WordPress. Now, it’s up to you to choose the right plugin to install that matches your needs perfectly.', '{\"v\":1,\"rows\":[{\"cols\":[{\"widgets\":[{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Overview\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>So, you have already built a WordPress website, spent a lot of time putting content, and finally launched it for your target audience. And you are waiting for your website to generate higher traffic, right? Well, your website will match your aim and expectation only if it’s SEO-friendly.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>When it comes to <a href=\\\"https://www.sunsys.in/seo-strategies-for-startups/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">search engine optimization</a>, it’s a well-tried and tested method of increasing organic traffic and making your website successful. It’s an ongoing process that involves numerous activities including on-page and off-page. You need to equally focus on both of these activities to achieve the desired results.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Meanwhile, if you have already developed your website on WordPress, you should not worry about SEO. The actual reason is this platform includes numerous resources to make your effort easy.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>To make fully optimization of your WordPress website, you need to just choose a top-quality WordPress theme that should be SEO-friendly. Apart from this, you should also install top 10 WordPress SEO plugins for website that help you implement the best strategy for search engine optimization perfectly.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"<strong>Related Links:</strong>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><strong><a href=\\\"https://www.sunsys.in/top-10-must-have-wordpress-plugins-for-your-business\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Top 10 Must-Have WordPress Plugins For Your Business</a></strong></p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Top 10 WordPress SEO Plugins\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><em>Now let’s discuss some of the WordPress SEO plugins that you can consider installing to improve the search engine ranking of your website. Explore the complete list.</em></p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"1.  Yoast SEO\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>While talking about some of the pop