plugin has great potential to compress them even without loss of extracted EXIF data, and quality, and optimize it in a better way. You can install the plugin easily to test certain images to check if the quality is up to your satisfaction.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Features:</p>\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":false,\"items\":[\"It can optimize any type of image\",\"Full compatibility with WP Retina 2X\",\"Option for conversion PNG to JPG\",\"Smart cropping\",\"Optimize features and thumbnail images\"]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Price:</p>\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":false,\"items\":[\"Basic version is available free of cost. The Premium version starts at $4.99 for 5,000 image credits.\"]},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Conclusion\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>So, after going through the above discussion, you may have enough idea about the above popular SEO plugins for WordPress. Now, it’s up to you to choose the right plugin to install that matches your needs perfectly.</p>\"}]}]}]}', 'Top 10 WordPress SEO Plugins for Better Performance of Website', 'You can improve search engine optimization (SEO) of your WordPress website by using the top 10 WordPress seo plugins. These are some of the best plugins that you can use.', '/uploads/blog/202410-b7275d86473d12b3.webp', (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'wordpress'), 'published', '2024-10-16 03:33:07', '2024-10-16 03:33:07', '2025-02-28 04:31:09');
INSERT IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, body, blocks, meta_title, meta_description, cover, category_id, status, published_at, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('top-10-must-have-wordpress-plugins-for-your-business', 'Top 10 Must-Have WordPress Plugins For Your Business', 'When it comes to WordPress, it’s one of the leading platforms that are good for developing varieties of websites with cutting-edge features and advanced functionalities. This platform is popular for …', 'Overview\n\nWhen it comes to WordPress, it’s one of the leading platforms that are good for developing varieties of websites with cutting-edge features and advanced functionalities. This platform is popular for being highly manageable, accessible, and also simple to use CMS (Content Management System).For a blog, no platform is as good as WordPress. Apart from this, you can also leverage it for developing magazines, corporate, and many other websites.\n\nThis platform brings the possibility of extending CMS solutions in an unlimited way. With the availability of themes, extensive support, and plugins, WordPress gains an edge over other CMS in various ways.The major advantage of developing your website on this platform is that it enables you to leverage several WP plugins.\n\nWith the use of plugins, you can make even an ordinary website extraordinary. It helps you develop a fully versatile website.So, what are WordPress (WP) Plugins?Well, WordPress Plugins are the software that you can use to integrate several new functionalities and features into your websites in the same way as the software does for your mobile phones. With the platform, you can get approximately 54,000 plugins to use.\n\nIt indicates every feature you need on your website.WordPress plugins work effectively when it comes to easing out the entire process of integrating several new features to your website even without compiling a single line of code. They can be both simple and complex based on your needs.You can get the option to go for either premium or freemium versions of plugins.\n\nYou need to take into account that paid versions of WordPress plugins are available with more offerings whereas free versions are available with limited versions. So, you need to go for the right version of plugins based on your exact requirements.\n\nApart from this, plugin API offers a complete set of filters and also various hooks that enable developers to change the existing functionalities of your website and add new ones. Besides, you can use them for different types of content, taxonomies, and custom files, which enable users to store different types of content rather than just posts and pages. Admin gets an option to either activate or deactivate the installed plugins.\n\nRelated Links:\n\nTop 10 WordPress SEO Plugins To Improve Website Performance\n\nTop 10 WordPress Plugins for Business Website\n\nWe will figure out here some of the popular WordPress plugins that are in high demand in 2022 and you can use for your website.\n\n1. Yoast SEO\n\nSearch engine optimization (SEO) has become highly important for improving the ranking of any website in Google. It improves your online presence by ensuring your top position in search engine result pages (SERPs).\n\nThanks to Yoast SEO, a popular WordPress plugin, that helps you make your website SEO friendly. It helps you implement the latest practices of search engine optimization that help your website generate more traffic.\n\nWhether you want to generate a sitemap, optimize social media, or meta tags, you can easily do the same with the help of this plugin. It helps you do on-page SEO most effectively.\n\nFeatures:\n\nCheck Readability\nSuggestion for Interlinking\nCreate Custom Description/Meta Header\nSocial Sharing\nPermalink Cleanups\n\nPrice:\n\nPrice: Freemium+ $99/Year\n\n2. WP Forms\n\nThis is another crucial plugin for your business website. We know how important a contact form is for any website. It acts as a channel that enables your users to approach you. It’s based on drag and drops form builder and is user-friendly that allows you to create varieties of forms be it online order forms, contact forms, payment forms, email subscription forms, survey forms, polls, or other important types of online forms.\n\nYou can create any form without putting much effort. This plugin is perfect to integrate with marketing and also payment platforms.\n\nFeatures:\n\nOrder & Payment Forms\nDrag & Drop Builder\n100+ Templates\nForm Landing Page\nModern File Upload Field\n\nPrice:\n\n$199.50/yr\n\n3. WP Rocket\n\nWhen it comes to quick page loading times, these are indeed highly crucial for every business. You can improve the loading speed of your website with the use of caching solutions. As a leading and premium caching plugin, it improves the loading speed of your website and thus makes it highly engaging.You can do the same with the cached copy of every dynamically created page and also minimizes the overall workload of your server. It also minimizes the weight of your HTML, JavaScript, and CSS file through minification.\n\nFeatures:\n\nCloudflare Compatibility\nImage Loading on Request\nWordPress Multisite Support\nImprove User-End Browsing Cache\nAdd Caching Solution with CDN\n\nPrice:\n\n$49/year (for 1 website), $99/year (3 websites), and $249/year (unlimited websites)\n\n4. Migrate Guru\n\nIt’s an automated WordPress migration plugin that offers an easy, quick, and also fully reliable method to migrate any type of WordPress website. This type of WP plugin works on an external server. With this plugin, you can easily transfer your larger sites even around 200 GB hassle-free.\n\nDuring the entire migration process, there are numerous options for omitting those various unnecessary files and also can save the migration setting. It allows you to repeat the process of migration even in the future with just one click.\n\nFeatures:\n\nOne-Click Migration\nFully Automatic\nApt for Large Sites\nNo Storage Space Needed\nTimely Alerts\n\nPrice:\n\nFree\n\n5. WP Legal Pages\n\nWP Legal Page is one of the plugins that are popular as an easy privacy policy generator. It includes 25+ policy page templates needed for CCPA and GDPR compliance. With just a couple of clicks, this WP plugin enables you to create several pages that include an eCommerce privacy policy, disclaimer, terms & conditions, affiliate policy, and many more.\n\nThe plugin is fully robust and also provides you with a simple softcode option. The wizard features a complete guide step-by-step of any kind of legal document. This way you can create a policy page that can be customized exclusively for your website.\n\nFeatures:\n\nEasy Shortcodes\nCCPA, GDPR, and COPPA Compliant\nLightweight\nEasy Installation\n25+ Editable Templates\n\n6. MonsterInsights\n\nWhen it comes to website analytics, plays a crucial role in the growth of your business. With this plugin, you can easily set up your Google Analytics on your website with a couple of clicks. You can easily observe the way your website performs.\n\nThis plugin makes it convenient for you to understand even those complex analytics most easily. With this type of information, you can also realize in terms of where you waste your time and also exclude the same when it comes to creating a data-driven strategy. It increases the audience.\n\nFeatures:\n\nGoogle Analytics Dashboard\nImproved Link Attribution\nTrack Ads\nEasy and Fast Setup\nReal-Time Stats\n\n7. WooCommerce\n\nWooCommerce is another popular WP plugin that helps you create an online store for selling anything. With the availability of numerous customization features and extensions, the plugin is the most useful for those who want to develop an eCommerce website with cutting-edge features and functionalities. Whether you wish to sell digital, physical, affiliate, or other products, you can leverage this plugin to fulfill your goal.\n\nFeatures:\n\nHighly Flexible\nExtensive Themes\nOpen-Source Platform\nIn-Built Payment\nLarger Library of Extensions\n\nPrice:\n\n$20 to $100/ year\n\n8. UpdraftPlus\n\nIt’s one of the leading WP plugins that provides both automated and scheduled backup solutions for a range of options that include email, Google Drive, Dropbox, and many more. It’s easy to install. The configuration of the plugin doesn’t require much time. The credit goes to its backup and restoration feature. Since backup is stored in the dashboard, you can avail of the option to access them later.\n\nFeatures:\n\nFully Comprehensive\nEasy to Use\nHighly Reliable\nRemote Storage Option\nEasy Migration of Website\n\nPrice:\n\n$195/year\n\n9. Akismet\n\nAkismet is another WP plugin that is a good option for those who are looking for an antispam plugin. It works better in evaluating all types of comments to filter out those various spam comments. This plugin can also check the URLs in the comments. It can remove various suspicious links as well. It includes a highly advanced security solution apart from anti-spam protection.\n\nFeatures:\n\nMonitor comments and removes spam\nDisplay only genuine comments\nAdvanced Spam Statistics\nPrivacy & GDPR Compliance\n\nPrice:\n\n$36/year\n\n10. Redirection\n\nAs the name suggests, this plugin works effectively when it comes to monitoring 301 redirects and 404-error. It’s a go-to plugin that is good for tracking those broken links and also various orphan pages. It brings the possibility for you to auto-track viewers of all types of URLs or also those of manually embed 302/307 redirects.\n\nFeatures:\n\nEasy to Install\nRedirect Logs\nAutomated Redirect\nManual Redirect\nRedirection by Logged-in Users\n\nPrice:\n\nN/A\n\nConclusion\n\nYou can leverage the potential advantages of WordPress only if you use the best plugins. It’s crucial to select the best plugins based on the type of functionality you wish to add to your website.', '{\"v\":1,\"rows\":[{\"cols\":[{\"widgets\":[{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Overview\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>When it comes to WordPress, it’s one of the leading platforms that are good for developing varieties of websites with cutting-edge features and advanced functionalities. This platform is popular for being highly manageable, accessible, and also simple to use CMS (Content Management System).For a blog, no platform is as good as WordPress. Apart from this, you can also leverage it for developing magazines, corporate, and many other websites.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>This platform brings the possibility of extending CMS solutions in an unlimited way. With the availability of themes, extensive support, and plugins, WordPress gains an edge over other CMS in various ways.The major advantage of developing your website on this platform is that it enables you to leverage several WP plugins.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>With the use of plugins, you can make even an ordinary website extraordinary. It helps you develop a fully versatile website.So, what are WordPress (WP) Plugins?Well, WordPress Plugins are the software that you can use to integrate several new functionalities and features into your websites in the same way as the software does for your mobile phones. With the platform, you can get approximately 54,000 plugins to use.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>It indicates every feature you need on your website.WordPress plugins work effectively when it comes to easing out the entire process of integrating several new features to your website even without compiling a single line of code. They can be both simple and complex based on your needs.You can get the option to go for either premium or freemium versions of plugins.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>You need to take into account that paid versions of WordPress plugins are available with more offerings whereas free versions are available with limited versions. So, you need to go for the right version of plugins based on your exac