type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Features:</p>\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":false,\"items\":[\"Cloudflare Compatibility\",\"Image Loading on Request\",\"WordPress Multisite Support\",\"Improve User-End Browsing Cache\",\"Add Caching Solution with CDN\"]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Price:</p>\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":false,\"items\":[\"$49/year (for 1 website), $99/year (3 websites), and $249/year (unlimited websites)\"]},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"4. Migrate Guru\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>It’s an automated WordPress migration plugin that offers an easy, quick, and also fully reliable method to migrate any type of WordPress website. This type of WP plugin works on an external server. With this plugin, you can easily transfer your larger sites even around 200 GB hassle-free.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>During the entire migration process, there are numerous options for omitting those various unnecessary files and also can save the migration setting. It allows you to repeat the process of migration even in the future with just one click.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Features:</p>\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":false,\"items\":[\"One-Click Migration\",\"Fully Automatic\",\"Apt for Large Sites\",\"No Storage Space Needed\",\"Timely Alerts\"]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Price:</p>\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":false,\"items\":[\"Free\"]},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"5. WP Legal Pages\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>WP Legal Page is one of the plugins that are popular as an easy privacy policy generator. It includes 25+ policy page templates needed for CCPA and GDPR compliance. With just a couple of clicks, this WP plugin enables you to create several pages that include an eCommerce privacy policy, disclaimer, terms &amp; conditions, affiliate policy, and many more.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>The plugin is fully robust an