 Some of these brands are WinTrust, Tryitfirst, iCure Diet Clinic, and others. It ensures a safe payment gateway and also ties up with many popular banks such as Yes Bank, ICICI bank, Paytm, Bill desk, and many others.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>PayKun also includes various payment links and buttons for quick transactions. Besides, it also offers free integration help and also a fully dedicated account manager, which is the other biggest advantage of using the same.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Features:</p>\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":false,\"items\":[\"Outstanding support\",\"120+ payment modes\",\"Quick settlement\",\"Affordable cost\",\"Amazing check-out experience\"]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Price:</p>\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":false,\"items\":[\"1.75% for a debit card, 2% for a credit card, 1.75% for net banking, and 3% for an international card.\"]},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"8. Stripe\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Stripe is another option for a payment gateway solution that businesses can use. Whether you sell your products domestically or globally, you can do with the use of this payment gateway. It also accepts multiple currencies from different countries.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Stripe is also the most preferred choice among merchants for having a great UI and UX compared to other payment gateways such as Razorpay and many others. It also offers various other products such as pre-built payment pages that are appropriate for all types of businesses as well.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Features:</p>\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":false,\"items\":[\"Mobile customer interface\",\"Digital wallet integration\",\"Mobile payment\",\"Multi-currency\",\"Credit card process\"]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Price:</p>\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":false,\"items\":[\"2% for domestic cards and 3% for international cards\"]},{\