Important?</a></p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Conclusion\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Choosing reliable payment gateways is something that not only helps customers make transactions smoothly but also improves their shopping experience. Above are some of the payment gateways that you can choose to integrate into your online store to make your online store successful.</p>\"}]}]}]}', 'Top 10 WooCommerce Payment Gateways in India (2023)', 'Integration of the right payment gateways into your WooCommerce website is necessary for its success. we have listed Top 10 WooCommerce Payment Gateways in India. Choose the right one wisely.', '/uploads/blog/202410-08cd4fb03032900d.webp', (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'woocommerce'), 'published', '2024-10-16 03:50:33', '2024-10-16 03:50:33', '2025-02-27 12:46:21');
INSERT IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, body, blocks, meta_title, meta_description, cover, category_id, status, published_at, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('best-woocommerce-plugins-to-website-development', 'Best WooCommerce Plugins to Website Development', 'In today’s competitive digital landscape, an eCommerce store that fails to deliver a seamless user experience risks frustrating customers, leading to a decline in conversion rates, sales, and overall…', 'Introduction\n\nIn today’s competitive digital landscape, an eCommerce store that fails to deliver a seamless user experience risks frustrating customers, leading to a decline in conversion rates, sales, and overall ROI. If you\'re running an online store on the WooCommerce platform, you’re in luck! WooCommerce offers a wide range of plugins that enhance functionality and improve user experience, making your store a complete solution for both small and large businesses.\n\nWhat is WooCommerce?\n\nWooCommerce is one of the most powerful WordPress plugins, designed specifically for online merchants. Whether you run a small or large eCommerce business, WooCommerce offers the flexibility and customization needed for success. Since its introduction in 2011, WooCommerce has grown rapidly in popularity due to its ease of installation, extensive features, and free base product. Many eCommerce websites rely on WooCommerce to power their online stores, making it one of the fastest-growing eCommerce platforms in the world.\n\nRelated Links:\n\nTop 10 WooCommerce Payment Gateways in India\n\nTop 10 WooCommerce Plugins to Enhance Your Site\n\nHere’s a list of top WooCommerce plugins you can leverage to boost your store’s functionality:\n\n1. WooCommerce Customizer Plugin\n\nThis plugin simplifies custom code implementation, allowing you to modify add-to-cart buttons, sales badges, checkout coupons, and more—all through visual editing settings.\n\nFeatures:\n\nCustomizes add-to-cart text, badges, and more\nFree extensions like MailChimp and WooCommerce Membership\nVisual editing capabilities\n\nPrice:\n\nFree\n\nPrice:\n\nFree\n\n2. Booster for WooCommerce\n\nBooster enhances your site with features like price conversion, global discounts, PDF invoicing, and more.\n\nFeatures:\n\nCustom price labels and buttons\nPDF invoicing and emails\nBoosts shipping and payment gateways\n\nPrice:\n\nFree (Premium version: $49.99)\n\n3. Checkout Field Editor\n\nThis plugin allows you to customize your checkout page by adding, removing, and editing fields.\n\nFeatures:\n\nCustomizes checkout fields with ease\nAdds new field types like labels, classes, etc.\n\nPrice:\n\nFree (Premium version available)\n\n4. PDF and Packing Slips\n\nAutomatically attach PDF invoices to emails and generate packing slips in bulk.\n\nFeatures:\n\nGenerates PDF invoices and packing slips\nSupports multiple languages\n\nPrice:\n\nFree (Pro version: €54.00)\n\n5. WooCommerce Multilingual Plugin\n\nTranslate every aspect of your store, from products to checkout pages, and offer multiple currencies\n\nFeatures:\n\nEasy multilingual setup\nSupports various currencies\n\nPrice:\n\nFree (Paid version: $99)\n\n6. PickPlugins Product Slider Plugin\n\nCreate engaging product sliders with this plugin to feature products on any page of your site.\n\nFeatures:\n\nSupports multiple product displays\nCustomizable animations and themes\n\nPrice:\n\nFree (Premium version: $29)\n\n7. EU VAT Compliance Assistant\n\nEnsure VAT compliance with this plugin, which automatically calculates VAT based on customer location.\n\nFeatures:\n\nSupports both physical and digital goods\nVAT rates for different countries\n\nPrice:\n\nFree (Premium version: $50)\n\n8. WooCommerce Menu Cart Plugin\n\nEasily add a shopping cart button to your website’s navigation menu.\n\nFeatures:\n\nQuick installation\nCustom CSS for advanced editing\n\nPrice:\n\nFree (Premium version: €27.00)\n\n9. YITH WooCommerce Compare\n\nThis plugin allows customers to compare products side by side, improving the shopping experience.\n\nFeatures:\n\nAdds a comparison button to products\nCustomizable settings for comparisons\n\nPrice:\n\nFree (Premium version: $63.99)\n\nBenefits of WooCommerce Plugins\n\nHere are some of the key advantages of using WooCommerce plugins for your website:\n\n1. Complete Control of Your Data\n\nWooCommerce plugins give you full control over your store’s data, ensuring secure backup and order history management.\n\n2. Custom Functionality\n\nWooCommerce offers the largest community of developers and plugins, allowing you to easily find or create custom features.\n\n3. Cost-Effective\n\nMost WooCommerce plugins are free, making it a budget-friendly option for online stores.\n\n4. Sell Any Type of Product\n\nYou can sell both digital and physical products, create memberships, and offer subscription-based products.\n\n5. SEO-Friendly\n\nWooCommerce is powered by WordPress, one of the most SEO-friendly platforms, giving your store a competitive advantage in search rankings.\n\n6. High-Grade Security\n\nRegular updates ensure that your store is secure, protecting both you and your customers.\n\nConclusion\n\nWooCommerce offers a wealth of plugins to enhance your eCommerce site’s functionality, user experience, and security. Whether you’re just starting out or looking to scale your business, these plugins can help you achieve your goals. If you need assistance with WooCommerce development, feel free to Connect with Us.', '{\"v\":1,\"rows\":[{\"cols\":[{\"widgets\":[{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Introduction\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>In today’s competitive digital landscape, an eCommerce store that fails to deliver a seamless user experience risks frustrating customers, leading to a decline in conversion rates, sales, and overall ROI. If you&#039;re running an online store on the WooCommerce platform, you’re in luck! WooCommerce offers a wide range of plugins that enhance functionalit