"]},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":false,\"items\":[\"SMM\",\"App Development\"]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><strong>Year of Establishment:</strong> 2009<br><strong>Location:</strong> Yeovil, United Kingdom<br><strong>Skills/Technologies:</strong> Result-focused web design, SEO, eCommerce, bespoke web development<br><strong>Clutch Ratings:</strong> 4/5</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"4. Visions Design\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Vision Design is a one-stop destination for getting all your needs covered, be it designing, branding, or everything related to technology. The company works with the finest approach to treat its clients like family.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Services</p>\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":false,\"items\":[\"Web Design\",\"Branding\",\"Video Creation\"]},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":false,\"items\":[\"Digital Marketing\",\"PPC Y\"]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><strong>Year of Establishment:</strong> 2010<br><strong>Location:</strong> Lymm, UK<br><strong>Skills/Technologies:</strong> Video Production, Branding, PPC, SEO<br><strong>Clutch Ratings:</strong> 5/5</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"5. Fortnight\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Fortnight is another popular website design company in the UK that specializes in conversion optimization, product research, UI/UX across web and mobile, web design, web development, creative design, branding, and more.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Services</p>\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":false,\"items\":[\"Brand Strategy\",\"Visual Identity\",\"Art Direction\"]},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":false,\"items\":[\"Wireframes &amp; Prototypes\",\"UI/UX Design\"]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><strong>Year of Establishment:</strong> 2014<br><strong>Location:</strong> London, UK<br><strong>Skills/Technologies:</strong> N/A<br><strong>Clutch Ratings:</strong> 4.7/5</p>\"},{\"type\":\"hea