html\":\"3. Voice search optimization\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Voice search optimization is a process of enabling websites to appear through the voice search feature. This has gained incredible popularity over the years because of its user-friendly and easy usage features. The evolution of this trend has been immense to a point where this optimization allows recognition of various voices and gives AI-based accurate results. Voice recognition enables multitasking and saves time for users.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Voice search optimization makes SEO campaigns more effective. It helps answer customer queries on websites easily and quickly. This develops more customer trust and loyalty.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>It is believed that Voice search assistants will grow up to 8 billion by 2023 making this optimization unavoidable.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"4. AI chatbots\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>We all know how chatbots are useful. AI chatbots are a better version of regular ones. To comprehend user intention and to provide a more humane experience, the technology uses Machine learning (ML) and Natural Language Processing (NLP). Among a ton of benefits, AI chatbots offer 24/7 problem-solving capabilities. AI chatbots are a long-term worthy investment as they can answer FAQs, connect users with available assistants, etc. They make development easier, provide exceptional user experience and it is established that self-learning bots are the future of this technology.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"5. Cyber security\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>With multiple processes being handled online, more digital data comes in. The protection of which is a priority to any business. Cyber security plays a huge role for the same. The development of algorithms, usage of IoT, GDPR (General Data Protection Regulation) is some of the evolving technologies in this field. Frameworks like Django or Ruby on Rails are used to avoid cross-site scripting. Sensitive data can be encrypted as precautions and possible attacks can be analyzed by monitoring suspicious activities.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"6. Motion UI\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Motion UI is a frontend web designing framework used to build responsive web designs. This comes with a predefined motion that can be used for any design. It is a new design approach that is expected to make websites more user-friendly, attractive, and intuitive. It involves custom animation integration and CSS transitions arranged from SASS, It is one of the most important trends in website development as it makes UI design faster and simpler.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"7. Multi experience\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>It is in the name – multi-experience refers to a whole user experience with a single application, across different digital touchpoints. This promotes a consistent user journey. Along with creating a user-friendly website, one should also focus on creating a multi-user experience – a dynamic website that adapts to common devices. This technology enables fast and scalable development across devices. Developers will have access to a range of front-end tools and backend services. This technology also enables low-code frameworks to establish more control over developers. These new web development trends can helps to increase your business growth.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"8. Data security\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>No breach is acceptable, be it theft, hacking or cyber-attacks. As the name suggests, data security is to protect digital data. Data security is the prime concern irrespective of what website or app one is dealing with. It helps use secure content management systems, plugins and extensions, choose secure hosts and use firewall applications.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"9. Cloud computing\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Cloud computing refers to using cloud-based services like storage, networking, analytics for convenience. This gives less worry to developers regarding storage space, and developers can work together from different geographical locations. This technology is cost-effective and facilitates easy accessibility to all team members. It is predicted that the cloud infrastructure field will grow up to 35% in 2022.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"10. Responsive websites\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Responsive websites are used to develop websites that adapt to different screen sizes. Top web development trends would be incomplete without responsive websites, It helps in improving user experience. This takes less time monitoring data analysis, is easy to maintain and the design will remain the same across devices. Google had announced that mobile responsive websites will rank higher in search engine algorithms.</p>\"}]}]}]}', 'Top 10 Web Development Trends in 2023', 'Observation of the speed of evolution of web development, year after year simply states how fast paced and active the field is. Here are some of the top 10 web development trends in 2023 that you must know.', '/uploads/blog/202410-6317b62ca6bff494.webp', (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'web-design'), 'published', '2024-10-16 05:45:03', '2024-10-16 05:45:03', '2025-02-27 11:48:39');
INSERT IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, body, blocks, meta_title, meta_description, cover, category_id, status, published_at, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('top-10-benefits-of-website-for-business', 'Top 10 benefits of website for business', 'Having an website is very important for any business these days.The internet is the main mode of marketing and communication for brands because of its wide range of reach, accessibility, and comfort.…', 'Overview\n\nHaving an website is very important for any business these days.The internet is the main mode of marketing and communication for brands because of its wide range of reach, accessibility, and comfort. Social media acts as the face of the brand with a variety of creative options to present products and services. However, that is not enough. What makes a brand credible and portrays the effort it puts into presenting, communicating, and settling on the internet?A website. A well-developed, designed, and capable website. It is everything a business can need to set foot. Being able to compete with industry goliaths needs many aspects, a website is numero uno. Many web design and web development companies in Bangalore aim to provide customized websites.Let’s see the reasons why a website is an important detail to focus on while setting up or enhancing your business\n\nRelated Links:\n\nTop 10 Reasons To Redesign Your Website\n\nBenefits of website for Business\n\n1. Professional outlook\n\nA website acts as the main face of the business. Brands or businesses in general that do not own a website are not taken seriously and are not considered trustworthy. Websites enhance the professional outlook of the business by adding a platform for potential customers and clientele to rely on and refer to for queries directly answered by the brand management.\n\n2. Improves credibility\n\nThis would not come as a surprise that a well developed website increases a brand’s credibility. When a customer looks for a product or service, no other platform delivers the required details and information as well as a website would. Now, why wouldn’t one want their brand to have that level of credibility by not investing in a website?\n\nFrom a customer’s perspective, a website is the main platform to gather enough information from and if that is missing on the whole, the brand loses a potential customer and fails to build a reputation.\n\n3. Enables reliable communication\n\nA major brand called BaskinRobbins was one of the first brands to launch vegan ice creams in India. They confirmed this launch through an announcement and product ingredient details mentioned in their website. Now, if this was communicated to customers only by store managers and employees, it wouldn’t hold as much reliability as the website did.\n\nThis is one example of how a website is a platform for official and reliable communication between a brand and its customers. A brand can communicate updates, discounts, career openings, product and service additions etc to their target market and potential clientele directly via web maintenance without having to invest extra monetarily.\n\n4. It is a social proof\n\nAlong with representation, a website marks a constant presence in a fast paced internet phase of the market. Although social media is a great way to interact and be present, a website serves as a constant, long term proof of existence on the internet as it is the basic representation of a brand. Social media pages can only have certain credibility, access and limited detail of the brand and act according to the trends to keep the brand relevant. A website, however, holds good for a long time to come, is a one time investment and the one that reaps consistent results.\n\n5. Builds a brand image\n\nA brand is a combination of various elements coming together to create an outlook and a representation. A website is a platform for that grand outlook. Over a period of time, a website enables a brand to build an image for itself. The functionality of the website, its design, uses and features help brands better their image in the industry by representing the quality of services available through a website. This enhances the reputation of the brand in the process.\n\n6. Has google search benefits\n\nIt is common knowledge that when a potential customer sees a need for something, the first act would be to seek Google Search for solutions. Web developers develop a website in a way implementing keywords to show up on web searches to direct traffic towards the website. Without a website how could a business’s products or service show up on searches? It doesn’t. A website acts as a pathway to traction and a well developed one offers many benefits beginning with gaining more virtual attention.\n\n7. Customer attraction\n\nWhile we are discussing credibility, reliable communication and professionalism, we ought to add customer attraction as a top feature of websites. It is the bare minimum a brand can do to attract customers. This can happen via online searches or ads stumbled upon by potential customers. Websites act as lead magnets with their reliability and hold potential sales boosting capabilities.\n\n8. Testimonial platform\n\nA website can serve as a platform to present client testimonials and reviews for better reliability of the brand and the website. This can be developed as a section of the website enabling potential customers to access, trying to understand the brand, its products and services. This also helps generate more leads and turn potential clients into sales.\n\n9. Enables centralized control or management\n\nA website once developed and published, can be set as a center for all official communication, announcements, discounts, clientele management, lead data management, query clarification and more. This enables an easy and a one stop control system allowing a smooth and encrypted functioning.\n\n10. Customer expectation\n\nAt a day and age like ours, a website is the bare minimum a brand can do to stay afloat. Customers today expect brands to function with user friendly websites containing all and every required information pertaining to a brand. Without a website, a brand would be letting down potential customers and not meeting technological standards to stay in business.\n\nConclusion\n\nA website is a portal of opportunities with many advantages waiting on the other side. In fast paced technological times like these, setting up a website is the first step. It is not an intimidating objective to get a website designed and developed. It is a very accessible and affordable service with many good developers offering the same. It is an acceptable fact by now that as a business owner or a brand manager, a website is a need and, it is also not a tough task to publish one.', '{\"v\":1,\"rows\":[{\"cols\":[{\"widgets\":[{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Overview\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Having an website is very important for any business these days.The internet is the main mode of marketing and communication for brands because of its wide range of reach, accessibility, and comfort. Social media acts as the face of the brand with a variety of creative options to present products and services. However, that is not enough. What makes a brand credible and portrays the effort it puts into presenting, communicating, and settling on the internet?A website. A well-developed, designed, and capable website. It is everything a business can need to set foot. Being able to compete with industry goliaths needs many aspects, a website is numero uno. Many web design and web development companies in Bangalore aim to provide customized websites.Let’s see the reasons why a website is an important detail to focus on while setting up or enhancing your business</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"<strong>Related Links:</strong>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><strong><a href=\\\"https://www.sunsys.in/top-10-reasons-to-redesign-your-website\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Top 10 Reasons To Redesign Your Website</a></strong></p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Benefits of website for Business\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"1. Professional outlook\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>A website acts as the main face of the business. Brands or businesses in general that do not own a website are not taken seriously and are not considered trustworthy. Websites enhance the professional outlook of the business by adding a platform for potential customers and clientele to rely on and refer to for queries directly answered by the brand management.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"2. Improves credibility\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>This would not come as a surprise that a well developed website increases a brand’s credibility. When a customer looks for a product or service, no other platform delivers the required details and information as well as a website would. Now, why wouldn’t one want their brand to have that level of credibility by not investing in a website?</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>From a customer’s perspective, a website is the main platform to gather enough information from and if that is missing on the whole, the brand loses a potential customer and fails to build a reputation.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"3. Enables reliable communication\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>A major brand called BaskinRobbins was one of the first brands to launch vegan ice creams in India. They confirmed this launch through an announcement and product ingredient details mentioned in their website. Now, if this was communicated to customers only by store managers and employees, it wouldn’t hold as much reliability as the website did.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>This is one example of how a website is a platform for official and reliable communication between a brand and its customers. A brand can communicate updates, discounts, career openings, product and service additions etc to their target market and potential clientele directly via web maintenance without having to invest extra monetarily.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"4. It is a social proof\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Along with representation, a website marks a constant presence in a fast paced internet phase of the market. Although social media is a great way to interact and be present, a website serves as a constant, long term proof of existence on the internet as it is the basic representation of a brand. Social media pages can only have certain credibility, access and limited detail of the brand and act according to the trends to keep the brand relevant. A website, however, holds good for a long time to come, is a one time investment and the one that reaps consistent results.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"5. Builds a brand image\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>A brand is a combination of various elements coming together to create an outlook and a representation. A website is a platform for that grand outlook. Over a period of time, a website enables a brand to build an image for itself. The functionality of the website, its design, uses and features help brands better their image in the industry by representing the quality of services available through a website. This enhances the reputation of the brand in the process.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"6. Has google search benefits\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>It is common knowledge that when a potential customer sees a need for something, the first act would be to seek Google Search for solutions. Web developers develop a website in a way implementing keywords to show up on web searches to direct traffic towards the website. Without a website how could a business’s products or service show up on searches? It doesn’t. A website acts as a pathway to traction and a well developed one offers many benefits beginning with gaining more virtual attention.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"7. Customer attraction\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>While we are discussing credibility, reliable communication and professionalism, we ought to add customer attraction as a top feature of websites. It is the bare minimum a brand can do to attract customers. This can happen via online searches or ads stumbled upon by potential customers. Websites act as lead magnets with their reliability and hold potential sales boosting capabilities.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"8. Testimonial platform\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>A website can serve as a platform to present client testimonials and reviews for better reliability of the brand and the website. This can be developed as a section of the website enabling potential customers to access, trying to understand the brand, its products and services. This also helps generate more leads and turn potential clients into sales.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"9. Enables centralized control or management\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>A website once developed and published, can be set as a center for all official communication, announcements, discounts, clientele management, lead data management, query clarification and more. This enables an easy and a one stop control system allowing a smooth and encrypted functioning.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"10. Customer expectation\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>At a day and age like ours, a website is the bare minimum a brand can do to stay afloat. Customers today expect brands to function with user friendly websites containing all and every required information pertaining to a brand. Without a website, a brand would be letting down potential customers and not meeting technological standards to stay in business.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Conclusion\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>A website is a portal of opportunities with many advantages waiting on the other side. In fast paced technological times like these, setting up a website is the first step. It is not an intimidating objective to get a website designed and developed. It is a very accessible and affordable service with many good developers offering the same. It is an acceptable fact by now that as a business owner or a brand manager, a website is a need and, it is also not a tough task to publish one.</p>\"}]}]}]}', 'Top 10 benefits of website for business', 'In this digital era if you have online business then its an smart way to expand wings of your business world wide. here are some top 10 benefits of website for business. check out', '/uploads/blog/202410-580e615e0d8d4318.webp', (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'web-design'), 'published', '2024-10-16 05:47:40', '2024-10-16 05:47:40', '2025-02-27 11:44:59');
INSERT IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, body, blocks, meta_title, meta_description, cover, category_id, status, published_at, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('top-10-reasons-to-redesign-your-website', 'Top 10 Reasons To Redesign Your Website', 'If you’ve owned a website for a few years, you know that it isn’t enough to develop it. It requires regular website maintenance, debugging, upgrades, and audits for desirable performance carried out …', 'Overview\n\nIf you’ve owned a website for a few years, you know that it isn’t enough to develop it. It requires regular website maintenance, debugging, upgrades, and audits for desirable performance carried out by the best redesign & maintenance company in Bangalore. But the rapidly altering technology is starting to make older websites look like internet fossils, and the only way to move forward is to get a website redesign.Wondering why you should invest in getting a website to revamp? Here are Top 10 reasons to redesign your website.\n\nRelated Links:\n\nTop 10 benefits of website for business\n\nReasons to Redesign Your Website\n\n1. Powerful First Impression\n\nList of reasons to redesign your websiteThese days, your website is like your identity card in the commercial world. If you have an active website, an enormous share of your customers finds your business through online portals.Having a website with all the latest design elements builds greater reliability about your business amongst potential customers.\n\n2. Beat Market Competition\n\nThe internet is home to businesses from all parts of the world. New companies are being established in your industry every single day. These companies will likely have the trending features on their respective websites, which make them an attractive alternative for browsers. By getting your website redesigned from time to time, you can always stay ahead of the loop. A technically superior web page will help you showcase your products and services better, which will help you earn higher revenues.\n\n3. \nBe More SEO-Friendly\n\nIt’s hard to make any profits online without an effective SEO strategy. Your SEO determines whether your target clientele will find your business on popular search engines or not. It’s responsible for your brand visibility, and in turn, your success. Getting a website redesign helps you inculcate new industry-related keywords and even add content marketing features that enable you to sustain this practice.\n\n4. Faster Loading Speed\n\nAs time goes on, the attention span of online audiences is getting increasingly small.People click off web pages within a few seconds in case there’s a loading issue. This problem is rampant among older websites because the framework has nearly expired. Due to accumulated and unorganized data, the loading speed gets relatively slow and isn’t comparable with current market standards. Thus, getting a website redesign can help you reduce your bounce rates.\n\n5. Better User Experience\n\nWhy your website need to redesignThe core purpose of redesigning a website is to make it more enticing for the users.Design changes majorly impact the front end of a website to enhance the user experience.This means that it’ll help website visitors access the products/services best suited for them more easily and, in turn, create a better brand image for you. The visual changes also ensure that your website becomes more memorable for the viewer and keep them coming back for more.\n\n6. Add New Features\n\nThe best part about the internet is that it never stops. There’s unlimited potential for growth, and every few months, a new tool or feature hits the market that completely changes how online businesses function.Even though this provides a golden opportunity for companies looking to scale quickly, it also means that your tech becomes old news quite quickly.It might not be viable to change your website every day, but getting a redesign gives you the option to incorporate the finest features which warrant longevity.\n\n7. Improved Lead Generation and Conversion\n\nIf you get your website redesigned by a capable company, then the end product is bound to be a delight for all your website visitors.Due to exciting graphics and easy navigation, Call To Action (CTA) yields better results for recently designed or redesigned websites.As a result, you will receive more clients from organic searches, and your ads will display greater performance. When your leads come across a website that highlights the best qualities of your business, conversion rates are bound to shoot up.\n\n8. Commercialize Your Content\n\nYou may have started your business website or blog simply to promote your content.But once your page takes off, you may want to alter the nature of it so that you can make some money out of the value you’re providing.A website redesign can help you switch to an E-commerce model. You can start selling your products online instead of just marketing them, boosting your revenue generation.\n\n9. Engaging View on Both Mobiles and PCs\n\nMore than 60.43% of all internet users browse websites on their mobile phones.Most online activities were limited to PCs, and mobile phones were primarily used for calling people.But now, the scenario has changed, and the mobility of phones allows people to access the internet anytime and anywhere.Thus, it’s crucial for your business website to have a great PC and mobile view. Older websites weren’t built with this schedule, and hence, they usually appear distorted when viewed on a phone screen. Getting a website redesign can help you solve this problem and get clients from all types of devices.\n\nConclusion\n\nThe perks of revamping your website are uncountable, but you must pick the right web redesign service provider company to execute the task.Sunsys Technologies is dedicated to providing its clients with the best IT services out there. The tech team will assess the current state of your website and devise custom strategies that help your business reach the peak of the industry.Hope these Top 10 reasons to redesign your website can help you for new website designing purpose.', '{\"v\":1,\"rows\":[{\"cols\":[{\"widgets\":[{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Overview\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>If you’ve owned a website for a few years, you know that it isn’t enough to develop it. It requires regular website maintenance, debugging, upgrades, and audits for desirable performance carried out by the best redesign &amp; maintenance company in Bangalore. But the rapidly altering technology is starting to make older websites look like internet fossils, and the only way to move forward is to get a website redesign.Wondering why you should invest in getting a website to revamp? Here are Top 10 reasons to redesign your website.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"<strong>Related Links:</strong>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><strong><a href=\\\"https://www.sunsys.in/top-10-benefits-of-website-for-business//\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Top 10 benefits of website for business</a></strong></p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Reasons to Redesign Your Website\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"1. Powerful First Impression\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>List of reasons to redesign your websiteThese days, your website is like your identity card in the commercial world. If you have an active website, an enormous share of your customers finds your business through online portals.Having a website with all the latest design elements builds greater reliability about your business amongst potential customers.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"2. Beat Market Competition\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>The internet is home to businesses from all parts of the world. New companies are being established in your industry every single day. These companies will likely have the trending features on their respective websites, which make them an attractive alternative for browsers. By getting your website redesigned from time to time, you can always stay ahead of the loop. A technically superior web page will help you showcase your products and services better, which will help you earn higher revenues.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"3. \\nBe More SEO-Friendly\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>It’s hard to make any profits online without an effective SEO strategy. Your SEO determines whether your target clientele will find your business on popular search engines or not. It’s responsible for your brand visibility, and in turn, your success. Getting a website redesign helps you inculcate new industry-related keywords and even add content marketing features that enable you to sustain this practice.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"4. Faster Loading Speed\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>As time goes on, the attention span of online audiences is getting increasingly small.People click off web pages within a few seconds in case there’s a loading issue. This problem is rampant among older websites because the framework has nearly expired. Due to accumulated and unorganized data, the loading speed gets relatively slow and isn’t comparable with current market standards. Thus, getting a website redesign can help you reduce your bounce rates.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"5. Better User Experience\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Why your website need to redesignThe core purpose of redesigning a website is to make it more enticing for the users.Design changes majorly impact the front end of a website to enhance the user experience.This means that it’ll help website visitors access the products/services best suited for them more easily and, in turn, create a better brand image for you. The visual changes also ensure that your website becomes more memorable for the viewer and keep them coming back for more.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"6. Add New Features\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>The best part about the internet is that it never stops. There’s unlimited potential for growth, and every few months, a new tool or feature hits the market that completely changes how online businesses function.Even though this provides a golden opportunity for companies looking to scale quickly, it also means that your tech becomes old news quite quickly.It might not be viable to change your website every day, but getting a redesign gives you the option to incorporate the finest features which warrant longevity.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"7. Improved Lead Generation and Conversion\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>If you get your website redesigned by a capable company, then the end product is bound to be a delight for all your website visitors.Due to exciting graphics and easy navigation, Call To Action (CTA) yields better results for recently designed or redesigned websites.As a result, you will receive more clients from organic searches, and your ads will display greater performance. When your leads come across a website that highlights the best qualities of your business, conversion rates are bound to shoot up.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"8. Commercialize Your Content\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>You may have started your business website or blog simply to promote your content.But once your page takes off, you may want to alter the nature of it so that you can make some money out of the value you’re providing.A website redesign can help you switch to an E-commerce model. You can start selling your products online instead of just marketing them, boosting your revenue generation.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"9. Engaging View on Both Mobiles and PCs\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>More than 60.43% of all internet users browse websites on their mobile phones.Most online activities were limited to PCs, and mobile phones were primarily used for calling people.But now, the scenario has changed, and the mobility of phones allows people to access the internet anytime and anywhere.Thus, it’s crucial for your business website to have a great PC and mobile view. Older websites weren’t built with this schedule, and hence, they usually appear distorted when viewed on a phone screen. Getting a website redesign can help you solve this problem and get clients from all types of devices.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Conclusion\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>The perks of revamping your website are uncountable, but you must pick the right web redesign service provider company to execute the task.Sunsys Technologies is dedicated to providing its clients with the best IT services out there. The tech team will assess the current state of your website and devise custom strategies that help your business reach the peak of the industry.Hope these Top 10 reasons to redesign your website can help you for new website designing purpose.</p>\"}]}]}]}', 'Top 10 Proven Reasons to Redesign Your Website', 'Know the Top 10 reasons to redesign your website. Outdated or old website will hurt your business visibility in anyway. click here to know more', '/uploads/blog/202410-b50f9b063fcfab91.webp', (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'web-design'), 'published', '2024-10-16 05:49:05', '2024-10-16 05:49:05', '2025-02-27 11:42:15');
INSERT IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, body, blocks, meta_title, meta_description, cover, category_id, status, published_at, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('top-10-business-tips-to-grow-your-small-business', 'Top 10 Business Tips to Grow Your Small Business', 'So, you have started your dream business venture and are running your small company? Well, you won half of the battle. Of course, starting a business is not an easy task as it involves a lot of compl…', 'Introduction\n\nSo, you have started your dream business venture and are running your small company? Well, you won half of the battle. Of course, starting a business is not an easy task as it involves a lot of complications. But, you will also face a lot of obstacles to growing your small business.\n\nYou should have a proven strategy to grow your small business and make it a successful brand. Irrespective of the type of business you operate, you should have a foolproof plan to boost the sales and revenue of your business.\n\nSo, if you are in search of the right tips and tricks to take your small business to the next level, you are in the right place. In this article, we will discuss some proven small business tips to grow your business.Take a look.\n\nRelated Links:\n\n5 Effective SEO Strategies for Successful Startups\n\nTop 10 Tips to Grow Your Small Business\n\n1. Perform Research\n\nFirst and foremost, you need to do in-depth research work and spend enough time on this. Market research helps you get details of your existing customers as well as your potential customers.\n\nIt’s crucial to gain a complete insight into your target customers and also be focused on gathering details about their exact requirements. It helps you know the way you can grow your business. It also helps you know several changes that you will come across.\n\nYou should even not forget to research your competitors. You should also get details about their both weaknesses and strengths which also will help you improve your decision in terms of the way to scale your small business.\n\n2. Get Details about your Customers\n\nNo matter how successfully you run your business, you can’t expect much growth unless you know your target customers. You should know the requirements of your customers. Once you know your customers, you can engage with them to grow your small business.\n\nIt’s good practice to go for user reviews, quarterly surveys or direct customer service communication, etc. to engage with your customers. You can ask them to share their honest opinions.\n\nApart from getting customers’ feedback, you should also focus on your target market and competitors. It’s the best idea to conduct a thorough analysis daily for ensuring that you are familiar with any competitive moves and also how different events tend to impact your customers. You can combine this with your customers’ opinions to find various potential avenues for the growth of your business.\n\n3. Build Sales Funnel\n\nThe next thing that you can do is build a sales funnel for your business. It’s another one of the most important small business tips for success. You need to keep in mind that your sales funnel can ensure the higher growth of your business. You should treat the sales funnel as a complete customer journey.\n\nOnce customers land on your website and visit it, they get on the top of the funnel. When they purchase your products or sign up for your services, it indicates that they already went through your sales funnel.\n\nYou can also try several ways to let people go through your sales funnel for selling your products. The best way to do so is to offer a discount or also gather their complete contact details and also send them the necessary updates related to your business.\n\n4. Improve Customer Services\n\nWorld-class customer service is something that ensures the success of your small business. So, if you wish to make your small business a brand, you need to first improve the quality of customer service.\n\nNo matter how good products and services you render, you will not be able to attract customers and boost sales unless you offer top-rated customer services. You need to understand that improving the quality of your customer service can indeed be a good avenue for the growth of your business.\n\nIf you treat customers exceptionally, they will prefer to leave various positive reviews. It also encourages them to recommend your services to their friends and also they will opt for your services again.\n\n5. Leverage the Power of Social Media\n\nAnother one of the crucial small business tips and advice is to use social media. No business can afford these days to ignore social media platforms. By leaps and bounds growing social media users, leveraging powerful social media platforms helps your business increase traffic to your website. It helps you discover more potential customers for your business, and increase sales, and revenue.\n\nAll you need to do to create a powerful strategy to get the maximum of social media, apart from selecting the best social media platforms to target for your business. You need to first shortlist all those social media platforms that accommodate most of your target customers.\n\nThe most crucial thing that you should do is determine and analyze the latest trends about your customers. You can use these insights for gaining and also running social ads.\n\nTo get the best results from social media, you need to ensure that you are active on a daily basis to interact with your followers. You need to read their comments and answer their messages as well. It helps you in brand building as well.\n\n6. Showcase your Specialization and Expertise\n\nIt’s crucial to display your expertise in a better way to create a good reputation among your customers and also give them the reason why they should hire you. It means offering resources, conducting research studies, hosting webinars, and also can run questions and answers with the help of social media platforms.\n\nYou should also find several opportunities for sharing what you know exactly, and also present it as a good opportunity to learn, understand, and grow. You can either provide links to any particular page or get contact details when you host any type of event. You can even also give access to download.\n\nShowcasing your expertise brilliantly helps you grow the audience for your business that will turn out to be your permanent customers after some time. You should also follow up and then keep offering complete and valuable insight and you can easily turn it into fully consistent growth.\n\n7. Grow Additional Income Streams\n\nIt’s one of the tips for small business owners. Since you run a small business, you may sometimes struggle to generate enough revenue from your main business model. If this is the case, you need to think about growing various other income streams.\n\nWell, you can do it by offering new products and services, different pricing models for different customers, or also subscriptions. You can also grow passive income through sponsorships and advertisements.\n\nOnce you start earning passive income, it helps you overcome financial stress and also run your business hassle-free.\n\nThe most crucial thing that you should keep in your mind is that your new initiatives make sense for your business. It just starts as your additional income for supporting your operation but may also require you to transition into a separate business altogether.\n\n8. Boost your Team\n\nThe next thing that you need to do is to grow your team. No business can become successful and survive for long without growing its team which is necessary to boost sales and revenue. It’s crucial to focus on discovering diverse voices that not only help you fulfill your core responsibilities but also offer you a unique perspective that can challenge you.\n\nYou need to understand that your employees need to polish their skills, especially with the growing technologies. Therefore, you need to focus on their professional development as well. It’s important for you to let them feel you value them and also their contribution to your business.\n\nYou should give them a brilliant opportunity to lead and collaborate, and also can involve them directly in the goal-setting process and encourage them to attend training and seminars.\n\nYou should understand that the way you treat your staff reflects the way you treat your customers as well. So, you should focus on these things.\n\n9. Focus on New Market\n\nIt’s always a good strategy to focus on the new market that brings a higher possibility for increasing demand for your products and services. Franchising is the best way of doing it and also gives you a chance to improve your customer base.\n\nMeanwhile, if your business is not fully franchisable, there are several options for franchising. For instance, you can expand your small business by exporting the same.\n\nYou should always be ready to grab several exporting opportunities, which means you can ship your offering across the world. It of course brings numerous advantages.  Some of these are;\n\nGetting benefits of several global platforms for selling your products and services online\nGrab opportunities to launch new business locations\nAccess more customers and businesses\nGlobalize your business and gain more market share\n\n10. Support Community\n\nNo small business can become a brand unless they support its community. As a small business owner, you should always be responsible for paying back to your community. You should always donate or sponsor those nonprofits and also offer free products or services for initiatives that you care about the most.\n\nYou can even go to partner with several other businesses with the same type of nonprofit interest as well for promoting a greater change as well. You should also go for promoting various socially responsible business practices, aside from sponsorship and donation. You should adopt all those right practices that help you grow your brand and improve its sustainability, and reputation in support of the community.\n\nConclusion\n\nSo, above are top 10 small business tips to grow your business ,that you can implement to flourish your small business. A robust strategy requires small business owners to make it a brand. While making a strategy, you should have complete information regarding your target customers, market, goal, etc.', '{\"v\":1,\"rows\":[{\"cols\":[{\"widgets\":[{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Introduction\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>So, you have started your dream business venture and are running your small company? Well, you won half of the battle. Of course, starting a business is not an easy task as it involves a lot of complications. But, you will also face a lot of obstacles to growing your small business.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>You should have a proven strategy to grow your small business and make it a successful brand. Irrespective of the type of business you operate, you should have a foolproof plan to boost the sales and revenue of your business.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>So, if you are in search of the right tips and tricks to take your small business to the next level, you are in the right place. In this article, we will discuss some proven small business tips to grow your business.Take a look.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"<strong>Related Links:</strong>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><strong><a href=\\\"https://www.sunsys.in/5-effective-seo-strategies-for-successful-startups\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">5 Effective SEO Strategies for Successful Startups</a></strong></p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Top 10 Tips to Grow Your Small Business\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"1. Perform Research\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>First and foremost, you need to do in-depth research work and