o is to set a targeted strategy for your business. If you are new to targeting SEO, you should create only those targets that are achievable easily, especially in the short run since SEO strategies tend to change fast based on customer behavior.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>The actual goal created at the initial phase ensures that targets can be achieved easily through the maximum usage of the search engine optimization strategy employed, and also in the case of those unachievable targets.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>All you need to do is to keep eye on the progress as changes in the website behavior are something that can improve the insight into the true working of those of the SEO model. Therefore, it enables any small business to adopt before they hit the rock bottom.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"3.  Use the Best Keywords\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Well, you need to understand the fact that search engine optimization is all about using the right keywords based on the type of products and services you render. So, you need to spend enough time selecting the best keyword and creating the right strategy for using the same.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>You need to keep in mind your content can appear on the first page of search results only if it includes the top search terms that your target audience uses. Therefore, it’s crucial to keep eye on user behavior and then implement the same into the content of your business. It gives you a kind of surety that your official page is indeed not lost.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>According to many researchers, the majority of users don’t look beyond those of the first search page display since they consider remain to be a sale rather than being the best as the ones on the top. You should always use the right combination of keywords to improve visibility. Apart from this, you need to focus on using long-tail keywords that will help you in increasing the visibility of your content.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"4. Keep Eyes on the Published Content\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Some marketers publish content and they forget the same, which is indeed a wrong thing. An effective search engine optimization strategy is something that businesses use to keep an eye on the content that they publish on their website. They need to analyze the performance behavior of their website well.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>If you don’t update the content or leave it unattended, it could be the biggest cause of failure of your website no matter how failed your search engine optimization strategy is.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Therefore, you need to make a proper routine to update the content. You should track content, state of publication, date, the relevance of keywords, and more. These are some of the crucial factors that work great in deciding the actual life of content. You should get the help of professionals or also have a dedicated team for SEO that can study the market trends and also ensure its long-term success.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"5. Check User Experience (UX)\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Even if your website appears on top in the search results, it will not engage customers for a long time unless it delivers an outstanding user experience. You need to be aware of the fact that UX is one of the crucial SEO factors for the ranking of your website.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Many factors such as incompatibility with devices that have small screens, poor navigation, and several other issues cause poor user experience. And it affects the SEO ranking of your website. So, you need to improve these things to boost the user experience.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Apart from this, you can also take several countermeasures such as keeping eye on user engagement, determining disengagement points, clear navigation, and validating a website’s mobile-friendliness attribute.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Conclusion\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>SEO has changed a lot in today’s time. If you wish to improve the online ranking of your website and improve its position in SERPs, you need to create a top-rated seo strategies for startups. Above are some of the useful strategies that you can try to get better outcomes.</p>\"}]}]}]}', 'Top 5 SEO Strategies For Startups To Grow Audience', 'If you are started an online business then these seo strategies for startups can help you to grow your audience and increase sales.', '/uploads/blog/202410-842ab7aeb724c142.webp', (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'seo'), 'published', '2024-10-16 05:54:32', '2024-10-16 05:54:32', '2026-07-16 10:35:43');
INSERT IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, body, blocks, meta_title, meta_description, cover, category_id, status, published_at, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('top-10-ecommerce-website-development-company-in-ahmedabad', 'Top 10 eCommerce Website Development Company in Ahmedabad', 'Top 10 eCommerce Website Development Companies in Kolkata Sunsys is a leading eCommerce website development company in Ahmedabad, specializing in diverse eCommerce solutions. With a focus on understa…', 'Related Links:\n\nTop 10 eCommerce Website Development Companies in Kolkata\n\nTop 10 eCommerce Website Development Companies in Ahmedabad\n\n1. Sunsys Technologies\n\nSunsys is a leading eCommerce website development company in Ahmedabad, specializing in diverse eCommerce solutions. With a focus on understanding business needs and market scenarios, Sunsys delivers customized eCommerce websites, including B2B, B2C, C2C, C2B, and B2A solutions.\n\nFounded In: 2009\nServices: Web Development, Digital Marketing, Website Hosting, Industry Development\nTechnologies: HTML, PHP, Linux, WordPress\nIndustries Specialized: eCommerce, Healthcare, Real Estate & Construction, Corporate, Hotel & Resort\n\n2. SIMFORM\n\nSIMFORM excels in creating robust eCommerce solutions for web and mobile platforms. It offers services from eCommerce strategy to custom storefront design, enhancing the retail experience across digital channels.\n\nFounded In: 2010\nServices: Product Engineering, Data Engineering, Quality Engineering, Cloud and DevOps Engineering\nTechnologies: N/A\nIndustries Specialized: Finance, Healthcare & Medical, Information Technology, eCommerce\n\n3. IceCube Digital\n\nIceCube Digital is known for leveraging platforms like Magento, Shopify, and WooCommerce to deliver high-quality eCommerce solutions. With a dedicated team and a result-driven approach, it ensures successful project outcomes.\n\nFounded In: 2008\nServices: eCommerce Development, Web Development, App Designing, Web Designing, Maintenance & Support\nTechnologies: Magento, Shopify, WordPress, WooCommerce, Magento2 Industry Specialized: Real Estate\n\n4. Viha Digital Commerce Pvt Ltd.\n\nViha Digital Commerce Pvt Ltd. is recognized for its Magento development expertise, offering comprehensive eCommerce solutions tailored to various business needs, including consulting and support.\n\nEstablished In: 2010\nServices: Magento Developers, WordPress Developers, Shopify Developers\nTechnologies: Magento, Shopify, WordPress\nIndustries Specialized: eCommerce, Retail, Lifestyle\n\n5. Techlifters\n\nTechlifters provides diverse eCommerce website solutions that help businesses maximize revenue. With expertise in platforms like Magento, WooCommerce, and Shopify, it develops engaging online stores.\n\nFounded In: 2018\nServices: Web Development, CMS Development, eCommerce Development, Digital Marketing\nTechnologies: Joomla, Magento, Bootstrap, WordPress, PHP, MySQL, Laravel\nIndustries Specialized: Medical, Photography, Real Estate, Restaurant, Construction, Education, Fashion, Event Management\n\n6. AddWeb Solution\n\nAddWeb Solution focuses on delivering effective eCommerce solutions for businesses of all sizes. It bridges the gap between technology and customers, offering a range of services including B2B, B2C, and C2C eCommerce solutions.\n\nEstablished In: 2012\nServices: Web Development, Mobile App Development, App Designing (UI/UX), Web Designing (UI/UX), eCommerce Development\nTechnologies: WordPress, Drupal, ASP.Net, React Native, AWS, Google Cloud\nIndustries Specialized: eCommerce, Information Technology\n\n7. PSD Webdesigns\n\nPSD Webdesigns provides professional eCommerce development services, focusing on storefront development and theme design. It specializes in BigCommerce and offers a wide array of solutions for online stores.\n\nEstablished In: 2018\nServices: BigCommerce Development, PSD to HTML, WordPress Development\nTechnologies: BigCommerce, WordPress, HTML\nIndustry Specialized: eCommerce\n\n8. Siddhi Infosoft\n\nSiddhi Infosoft creates exceptional eCommerce solutions that enhance product sales and growth. It offers a range of services including Prestashop, Magento, BigCommerce, and OpenCart development.\n\nEstablished In: 2011\nServices: Mobile App Development, Web Development, eCommerce Development, JavaScript Development\nTechnologies: PHP, Joomla, Laravel, WordPress, React Native, Android, iOS, and more\nIndustries Specialized: eCommerce, Business Services, Information Technology\n\n9. App Ideas InfoTech Pvt Ltd.\n\nWith over seven years of experience, App Ideas InfoTech Pvt Ltd. offers a variety of eCommerce development services, including custom website design, cart development, and third-party integration.\n\nEstablished In: 2015\nServices: Mobile App Development, Web Development, eCommerce Development, Game Development\nTechnologies: Android, IoT, Angular, PHP, WordPress, Shopify, Magento, Joomla\nIndustries Specialized: Advertising and Marketing, Automotive, Business Services\n\n10. WebCreta Technologies\n\nWebCreta Technologies specializes in custom eCommerce development, offering services such as theme customization, extension development, and maintenance. It supports multiple platforms, including Magento, OpenCart, BigCommerce, WooCommerce, and Shopify.\n\nEstablished In: 2015\nServices: eCommerce Development, Web Development, Mobile App Development, Digital Marketing\nTechnologies: PHP, HTML, MySQL, Magento, Shopify, WooCommerce\nIndustry Specialized: eCommerce\n\nChoosing the right eCommerce development company can be challenging. Here are some tips to help you make an informed decision\n\nCheck their Portfolio: Review the company\'s previous work to assess quality.\n\n1. Check their Portfolio\n\nReview the company\'s previous work to assess quality.\n\n2. Look for Expertise\n\nEnsure the company has experience in your required technology stack.\n\n3. Client Testimonials\n\nRead reviews to gauge client satisfaction and company reputation.\n\n4. Discuss Your Goals\n\nCommunicate your project objectives and ensure the company understands your vision.\n\n5. Budget and Timelines\n\nClarify project budget and timelines to ensure compatibility.\n\nConclusion\n\nSelecting the best eCommerce website development company is crucial for your online business success. The companies listed above have proven track records in delivering tailored eCommerce solutions. Consider your business goals, budget, and required services before making a decision.', '{\"v\":1,\"rows\":[{\"cols\":[{\"widgets\":[{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"<strong>Related Links:</strong>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><strong><a href=\\\"https://www.sunsys.in/top-10-ecommerce-website-development-companies-in-kolkata/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Top 10 eCommerce Website Development Companies in Kolkata</a></strong></p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Top 10 eCommerce Website Development Companies in Ahmedabad\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"1. Sunsys Technologies\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Sunsys is a leading eCommerce website development company in Ahmedabad, specializing in diverse eCommerce solutions. With a focus on understanding business needs and market scenarios, Sunsys delivers customized eCommerce websites, including B2B, B2C, C2C, C2B, and B2A solutions.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":false,\"items\":[\"Founded In: 2009\",\"Services: Web Development, Digital Marketing, Website Hosting, Industry Development\",\"Technologies: HTML, PHP, Linux, WordPress\",\"Industries Specialized: eCommerce, Healthcare, Real Estate &amp; Construction, Corporate, Hotel &amp; Resort\"]},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"2. SIMFORM\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>SIMFORM excels in creating robust eCommerce solutions for web and mobile platforms. It offers services from eCommerce strategy to custom storefront design, enhancing the retail experience across digital channels.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":false,\"items\":[\"Founded In: 2010\",\"Services: Product Engineering, Data Engineering, Quality Engineering, Cloud and DevOps Engineering\",\"Technologies: N/A\",\"Industries Specialized: Finance, Healthcare &amp; Medical, Information Technology, eCommerce\"]},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"3. IceCube Digital\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>IceCube Digital is known for leveraging platforms like Magento, Shopify, and WooCommerce to deliver high-quality eCommerce solutions. With a dedicated team and a result-driven approach, it ensures successful project outcomes.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":false,\"items\":[\"Founded In: 2008\",\"Services: eCommerce Development, Web Development, App Designing, Web Designing, Maintenance &amp; Support\",\"Technologies: Magento, Shopify, WordPress, WooCommerce, Magento2 Industry Specialized: Real Estate\"]},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"4. Viha Digital Commerce Pvt Ltd.\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Viha Digital Commerce Pvt Ltd. is recognized for its Magento development expertise, offering comprehensive eCommerce solutions tailored to various business needs, including consulting and support.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":false,\"items\":[\"Established In: 2010\",\"Services: Magento Developers, WordPress Developers, Shopify Developers\",\"Technologies: Magento, Shopify, WordPress\",\"Industries Specialized: eCommerce, Retail, Lifestyle\"]},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"5. Techlifters\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Techlifters provides diverse eCommerce website solutions that help businesses maximize revenue. With expertise in platforms like Magento, WooCommerce, and Shopify, it develops engaging online stores.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"ordered\":false,\"items\":[\"Founded In: 2018\",\"Services: Web Development, CMS Development, eCommerce Development, Digital Ma