ption only if you have a new website. The reason is it minimizes teamwork. Apart from this, it can also minimize the timeline for creating a website if you want to take your products to the market quickly.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>When it comes to the custom design approach, it reflects that the designer crafts a mockup of your website completely from scratch. This is indeed the best option for those who are planning for a larger investment and seeking to get top-quality design.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"5. Payment Merchant\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>A payment gateway is one of the crucial features of an eCommerce store that facilitates buyers to do online transactions successfully for products they buy. You need to understand that the choice of payment gateway also makes a great impact on your eCommerce development cost. You can get the three most popular options for payment gateways such as Paypal, Stripe, and Authorize.net</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Whether you select a WooCommerce or Shopify platform, you will get an option to integrate all these payment gateways. The processing fees for these gateways are 2.9% and also they charge an additional amount of $0.30 for every transaction. Besides, you also need to pay certain additional setup fees, which depend on your selection of the payment gateway.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"6. Product Images\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>The next thing that you need to invest in is the images of your products that you need to display on your online store. These images not only represent your products but also make your website appealing. If your organization doesn’t have a logo, you need to invest in having one created as a part of your marketing plan.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Meanwhile, you need to understand that these images are not free. You need to use only original images of your products on your website. It helps you avoid any legal complications in the future.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>So, you need to hire a professional photographer to get original pictures for your website. You can find them on a different budget. Therefore, you should hire them based on your ecommerce website cost.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"7. Content\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Content is one of the crucial things that determine the success of your eCommerce store. It informs users about products in detail, in terms of features and specifications. You need content for different categories of products, apart from Home Page, About Us, Privacy Policy, and others.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>So, you need to choose content writing services, which also have an impact on the cost of eCommerce website development.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"8. Shipping Partner\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Choosing the right shipping partner for your eCommerce service is highly important. You can find various options while searching for shipping partners, including FedEx, DHL, Ekart, Blue Dart, eCom Express, and many more. These shipping partners have different charges. So, choosing them also makes a huge impact on your eCommerce website development cost.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"9. Maintenance Cost\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>No matter how advanced your eCommerce store is, it needs a regular website maintenance service. You get tools from your eCommerce engines that you require for managing your customers’ data, products, and promotions. eCommerce software often gets updated to offer various cutting-edge features and also boost security and various updates that you need to apply by those of many knowledgeable developers. It’s good to continue the partnership with your developers to get the required maintenance and support for your website.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"10. SSL Certificate\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>No matter what, the security of your online store is something that you are not supposed to compromise in any case. There are several ways you can use to secure your eCommerce website – implementing an SSL certificate is one of those ways.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Some hosting plans are available with free SSL whereas others are available with paid SSL. So, it’s advisable to go through the complete hosting plan and then choose the right one accordingly.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>If you choose a hosting plan that offers free security, it minimizes your investment.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Conclusion\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>Hope this Guide to eCommerce website development cost plan will help in reducing the budget burden. Do you still have any confusion in planning a budget for your eCommerce website? Well, if not, it’s time to involve active preparation for your online store development.</p>\"}]}]}]}', 'eCommerce Website Development Cost | Complete Guide', 'If you have a plan to start ecommerce business with a great website design you should be aware this ecommerce website development cost.', '/uploads/blog/202410-a802d4b0f3dbc97b.webp', (SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'e-commerce'), 'published', '2024-10-16 06:51:17', '2024-10-16 06:51:17', '2025-02-27 08:57:30');
INSERT IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, body, blocks, meta_title, meta_description, cover, category_id, status, published_at, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('top-10-benefits-of-ecommerce-for-small-business', 'Top 10 Benefits of eCommerce for Small Business', 'In today’s time, the internet has made a good impact on people’s lives. They have now become more internet savvy and engage in different activities. Be it finding a new route, searching for new resta…', 'Introduction\n\nIn today’s time, the internet has made a good impact on people’s lives. They have now become more internet savvy and engage in different activities. Be it finding a new route, searching for new restaurants, or booking tickets for a movie, people use the Internet nowadays for different purposes. It would be not wrong to say that living life without the internet is not possible.\n\nSo, if you are a small business owner, you need to focus on making a robust online presence for your business. It not only helps you in tantalizing the sense of more customers but also helps you increase the sales and revenue of your business.\n\nAnd eCommerce solutions will help your business in fulfilling its goal and pave the way for growth. We will discuss here how eCommerce solutions help your small business grow in the year 2022.\n\nRelated Links:\n\nBest 6 Tips To Hire Best Ecommerce Web Design Company\n\nBenefits of eCommerce for Small Businesses\n\n1.  Minimize Operational Cost\n\nThe biggest advantage of getting eCommerce solutions is it makes your business operation smooth. Being a brick-and-mortar business owner, you might be aware of the fact of how expensive it is to run a physical store. You often need to spend huge bucks on purchasing or renting premises, electricity costs, labor, etc.On the other hand, if we talk about an online store, it needs fewer expenses compared to a physical store. In this, owners don’t need to spend their money on purchasing premises. They need a limited capital outlay.More and more, even if you hire an eCommerce website development company, it also costs less and thus prevents you from spending much on it. You can easily compensate for the development cost of your online store with the profit that you make from selling your products.Apart from this, you can also avail of various additional savings that are made as those of physical stores where professionals need to handle payments, inventory, delivery, etc. Well, eCommerce comes with the capability of automating the entire process of operation.So, the online store is highly affordable and the best option for small businesses seeking to make their online presence to grab more sales and growth opportunities.\n\n2. Higher Customer Acquisition\n\nYou need to understand that the portfolio of an organization offers a complete glimpse into their expertise and also the type of project they handle. It helps you check the diversity in their portfolio and determine whether their design and development align perfectly with your vision.It’s advisable to pay full attention to the aesthetics, functionality, and user experience of the websites they developed. If you find your selected company has experience in developing a similar website matching your vision, it’s a great reflection of their capability of offering your project.\n\n3. Maximize your Business Reach\n\nIt’s another advantage of having an eCommerce solution for your business. If you own a physical store, you need to work hard to make the right strategy to maximize your business reach. Still, there’s no guarantee that you will be successful.\n\nMoreover, if you have an online store, you don’t need to make a sales strategy for different locations. You can sell your products globally, no matter where your business is located. If you opt for shipping solutions, you can ship your products across multiple pin codes across the country.\n\nIn other words, you can cater to customers from multiple locations across the country even at a single location.\n\n4. Boost Revenue\n\nAny business can’t be successful unless it focuses on increasing revenue. Irrespective of the popularity of your physical store, it’s often limited in some geographical areas. As mentioned above, an online store gives you a kind of flexibility to cater to customers across the world.\n\nEven if you are a small business owner, you don’t need to rely on foot traffic. Instead of this, you can offer and sell your products worldwide. Apart from this, you will also be able to gain the attention of various new customers. It increases both the conversion and sales revenue of the small business.\n\nApart from this, a brick-and-mortar business can’t open 24/7. Meanwhile, online stores are always available to cater to customers. Customers, on the other hand, avail themselves of the flexibility to purchase their favorite products whenever they wish.\n\nThese are the reasons why online stores are capable of increasing sales and it also makes a significant impact on their revenue.\n\n5. Expand your Business\n\nAnother advantage of having an online store is that it helps you expand your offers for sale. You can expand your business horizon hassle-free by acquiring more customers and also diversifying your sales. It’s indeed a perfect way of taking your brand from traditional to an innovative one.\n\nWith an eCommerce business, you don’t need to have more than one brand. The reason is just a single store enables you to make your reach among customers without having any worry about moving locations. Whether you are dealing with B2B or B2C, you will find eCommerce solutions that will be helpful for both. And it improves your brand reach.\n\n6. Personalize Shopping Experience\n\nPersonalizing the shopping experience is something that is the most effective way to attract customers to buy your products and services. When you run a physical store, it’s certainly not possible to serve every single buyer in a personalized way. You can’t be behind every buyer and ask about their needs or why they don’t buy your products.\n\nWith eCommerce, you will be able to know what discourages buyers from purchasing your products. You can go through the analytics to gather every detail of buyers and it helps you in matching their needs and expectations in a personalized way.\n\n7. Increase Sale\n\nWell, now after going through all the above points, you can easily understand how eCommerce works effectively in improving sales. As mentioned above, an online store ensures your 24/7 presence among your target customers.\n\nSo, customers don’t need to follow any time limit for purchasing products. They can purchase their products anytime whenever they get time flexibility.\n\n8. Transaction Security\n\nMost people have a myth that online transactions are less secure. But, the reality is that online transactions are highly secured even compared to physical stores. When you access a physical store, there’s the possibility that anyone can spy on your payment card details.\n\nWhen you purchase your products from any online store, you don’t need to visit any store. So, you don’t need to be afraid of spying on your card details. Apart from this, the eCommerce website also includes an SSL certificate that makes the transaction more secure.\n\nThis certificate ensures safe browsing. Apart from this, it’s also crucial for keeping your data fully encrypted in a way that it’s fully safe and you can use keys and passwords without any problem. The certificate not only keeps your customers’ account information safe but also protects their credit card information. And thus helps them get rid of stress.\n\nToday, customers are highly concerned about payment security. So, sellers should take responsibility for offering solutions that ensure complete safety and trust in shopping processes.\n\nWhat Is Website Maintenance And Why It is Important?\n\nConclusion\n\nHope you got to know about advantages of ecommerce for small business. So, if you are seeking to grow your small business and make it an established brand, you need to opt for eCommerce solutions. Above are some of the advantages that you can expect from having an eCommerce website for your business.', '{\"v\":1,\"rows\":[{\"cols\":[{\"widgets\":[{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Introduction\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>In today’s time, the internet has made a good impact on people’s lives. They have now become more internet savvy and engage in different activities. Be it finding a new route, searching for new restaurants, or booking tickets for a movie, people use the Internet nowadays for different purposes. It would be not wrong to say that living life without the internet is not possible.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>So, if you are a small business owner, you need to focus on making a robust online presence for your business. It not only helps you in tantalizing the sense of more customers but also helps you increase the sales and revenue of your business.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>And eCommerce solutions will help your business in fulfilling its goal and pave the way for growth. We will discuss here how eCommerce solutions help your small business grow in the year 2022.</p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"<strong>Related Links:</strong>\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p><strong><a href=\\\"https://www.sunsys.in/best-6-tips-to-hire-best-ecommerce-web-design-company\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Best 6 Tips To Hire Best Ecommerce Web Design Company</a></strong></p>\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"html\":\"Benefits of eCommerce for Small Businesses\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"html\":\"1.  Minimize Operational Cost\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"html\":\"<p>The biggest advantage of getting eCommerce solutions is it makes your business operation smooth. Being a brick-and-mortar business owner, you might be aware of the fact of how expensive it i